  user_input {
    user_response: "Can you build me an android app similar to Mx Player that supports various video formats, hardware acceleration, and subtitle customization features. It should also include gesture controls for brightness and volume adjustment. and a user-friendly dark/light mode interface. plus support for local media streaming. that includes a file browser and playlist management functionality. make sure it runs efficiently on low-end devices. for smooth playback across all hardware configurations. also make sure security is prioritized with encrypted database storage for local files. also it should have a chromium based browser for downloading m3u8 files and converting to mp4 format seamlessly. Name this application \'PlayThat!\' and should have a unique icon. Let\'s focus on an intuitive user interface.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nInstructions: If you need more context from the user you must first ask the user some questions using the ask_question tool. If you ask questions, you must wait for the user\'s answers. After the questions you must present a plan.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_END]"
    items {
      text: "Can you build me an android app similar to Mx Player that supports various video formats, hardware acceleration, and subtitle customization features. It should also include gesture controls for brightness and volume adjustment. and a user-friendly dark/light mode interface. plus support for local media streaming. that includes a file browser and playlist management functionality. make sure it runs efficiently on low-end devices. for smooth playback across all hardware configurations. also make sure security is prioritized with encrypted database storage for local files. also it should have a chromium based browser for downloading m3u8 files and converting to mp4 format seamlessly. Name this application \'PlayThat!\' and should have a unique icon. Let\'s focus on an intuitive user interface.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nInstructions: If you need more context from the user you must first ask the user some questions using the ask_question tool. If you ask questions, you must wait for the user\'s answers. After the questions you must present a plan.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_END]"
