  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Considering Android App Features**\n\nI\'m currently focused on the core features for this Android app, envisioning functionality mirroring Mx Player. I\'m prioritizing diverse video format support, hardware acceleration for smooth playback, and detailed subtitle customization. I\'m exploring intuitive gesture controls for screen brightness and volume adjustments. I am also investigating adding features such as aspect ratio controls.\n\n\n**Prioritizing PlayThat! Features**\n\nI\'ve refined the feature set for \"PlayThat!\", focusing on a dark/light mode, local media streaming (file browser, playlists), and ensuring smooth playback on low-end devices. I\'m prioritizing security, including encrypted database storage. I\'m now integrating a Chromium-based browser for streamlined m3u8 download/conversion to mp4, aiming for an intuitive UI and a unique icon.\n\n\n"
