  planner_response {
    response: "I am preparing the architecture and interface for **PlayThat!**, modeled after MX Player with gesture controls, multi-format media playback, subtitle customization, encrypted private vault, and an in-app browser for M3U8 stream capture and MP4 conversion.\n\nTo ensure the app best matches your vision, please select your preferences for the questions below:"
    thinking: "**Initiating Strategic Planning**\n\nI\'m currently focused on the initial planning phase. The system requires gathering more information from the user before proceeding, and I must use the \'ask_question\' tool to do so. My immediate priority is to understand the context of the user\'s needs. I\'m strategizing how to best approach the information gathering process.\n\n\n**Refining Data Gathering**\n\nI\'ve carefully reviewed the \'ask_question\' tool\'s specifications. Now, I\'m concentrating on crafting precise, concise questions and options. My main priority is to adhere strictly to the plain text format and the limitations on length for questions and options. The structure and number of options per question are being designed to maximize the efficacy of data collection. I must make sure that it all fits together, and does not overwhelm the user.\n\n\n**Prioritizing Feature Implementation**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on the crucial features for \'PlayThat!\'. My goal is to guarantee smooth playback on diverse hardware by focusing on the web application runtime. I\'m prioritizing security with encrypted local file storage. Integrating a Chromium-based browser is next, ensuring seamless M3U8 download and conversion to MP4. The name \'PlayThat!\' and a unique icon are also key considerations. Finally, I\'m concentrating on designing a user-friendly interface.\n\n\n**Defining User Experience**\n\nI am now focusing on refining the user experience. I\'m prioritizing options for hardware acceleration mode toggles. I need to ask clarifying questions about the UI form factor, such as whether to prioritize an adaptive responsive full-screen app or a dedicated mobile app shell. I\'m also considering subtitle styling and file management. My main goal is to create a seamless playback experience.\n\n\n**Evaluating Interface Designs**\n\nI\'m now deep in the interface design phase, formulating precise questions. My focus is on the Chromium browser integration and the download workflow, and I\'m finalizing questions related to the encrypted vault\'s unlocking method. I am carefully adhering to the plain text format and length constraints.\n\n\n"
