  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing Artifact Location**\n\nI\'m currently verifying the artifact directory path provided. Specifically, I\'m checking the location, as well as the target file location, to ensure accurate data retrieval. I\'m focusing on validating the file and directory paths.\n\n\n**Verifying Planning Instructions**\n\nI\'ve carefully reviewed the planning mode instructions, paying close attention to the SKILL guidelines. I\'m focusing on the constraints regarding file operations and artifact creation, ensuring I adhere to the directive of not modifying application source files. I\'m building out the implementation plan artifact structure, and plan to be ready to request approval soon.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_455398"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"ArtifactMetadata\":{\"RequestFeedback\":true, \"Summary\":\"Comprehensive implementation plan for PlayThat! \342\200\223 an MX Player-inspired Android media player web app featuring dual-zone gesture controls, multi-format media playback, subtitle customization, hardware acceleration simulation, an in-app browser with M3U8 sniffer and MP4 converter, playlist and folder management, and an AES-GCM encrypted private vault with PIN/pattern lock and emergency disguise.\", \"UserFacing\":true}, \"CodeContent\":\"# PlayThat! - Android Media Player & Stream Converter\\n\\nA high-performance, MX Player-inspired Android media playback and stream capture experience. Features dual-edge vertical and horizontal gesture controls, extensive subtitle customization, hardware/software decoding toggles, an in-app browser with live M3U8 stream sniffing and MP4 conversion, network and local media streaming, and an AES-GCM encrypted private media vault with PIN/pattern authentication and emergency disguise.\\n\\n## User Review & Critical Decisions\\n\\n> [!IMPORTANT]\\n> The following architectural and UX choices have been confirmed and will guide the build:\\n\\n- **Confirmed Viewport & Shell**: Adaptive responsive layout with an optional Android device frame toggle (smartphone/tablet chassis with Android status bar, gesture pill, and full-screen landscape player mode).\\n- **Confirmed In-App Browser & Downloader**: Integrated Chromium-style browser tab with an active network traffic sniffer that detects `.m3u8` and video streams, displays segment download progress, and remuxes/converts them seamlessly into playable MP4 files stored in the local library.\\n- **Confirmed Security & Vault Lock**: Client-side AES-256-GCM encrypted vault (using WebCrypto API and IndexedDB) protected by a 4-to-6 digit PIN or 3x3 pattern lock, featuring a one-tap emergency disguise (instant switch to a working Android Calculator/Notes mockup).\\n- **Performance on Low-End Devices**: Virtualized media lists, canvas/WebGL hardware acceleration mode toggles, progressive segment caching, and light/dark theme tokens optimized for high frame-rate mobile rendering.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 1. Overview & Core Concept\\n\\n**PlayThat!** recreates the beloved Android MX Player experience within a modern web technology stack, bridging high-fidelity mobile ergonomics with real media capabilities:\\n\\n- **Touch & Gesture Media Player**: Left-edge vertical swipe for screen brightness adjustment, right-edge vertical swipe for audio volume adjustment with boost, horizontal swipe for precision time seeking with time delta and thumbnail preview, double-tap to play/pause or fast-forward (+10s / -10s), pinch-to-zoom and aspect ratio toggling (Original, Fit, Stretch, 16:9, 4:3, Crop).\\n- **Decoding Engines**: Switchable decoder modes (`HW`, `HW+`, `SW`) supporting standard video codecs, WebGL shader color correction / sharpening (simulating hardware post-processing), and audio enhancement.\\n- **Advanced Subtitle Engine**: Load external `.srt`, `.vtt`, or embedded subtitle tracks with real-time customization of font family, font size, text color, outline, background opacity, vertical position alignment, and subtitle sync delay (-5.0s to +5.0s).\\n- **In-App Browser & M3U8-to-MP4 Converter**: Chromium-style navigation bar, bookmarks, and simulated mobile web engine with an automated stream sniffer. When an HLS `.m3u8` stream or direct media URL is detected, users get an immediate download badge to pull segments, merge chunks into an MP4 blob, and save it directly to the media library.\\n- **Encrypted Private Vault**: Dedicated \\\"Private Folder\\\" where sensitive video and audio files are encrypted with user-derived keys (PBKDF2 + AES-GCM 256-bit). Files are not accessible or inspectable without the correct PIN/Pattern, and an Emergency Disguise button instantly replaces the screen with an innocent utility app.\\n- **Media File Manager & Playlists**: Folder tree browsing, video thumbnail previews, duration and resolution tags, favorite bookmarks, custom playlists, recent watch history with resume playback timestamps, and local network streaming (HTTP/HLS/DASH/MP4 stream URLs).\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 2. User Experience & Visual Design\\n\\n### Key User Flows\\n\\n1. **Browsing & Folder Navigation**:\\n   - The user opens PlayThat! and lands on the **Folders / Videos** view styled with Android Material You + MX Player card aesthetic.\\n   - Folders (e.g., *Camera, Downloads, Stream Captures, Movies, Series*) display video counts and unread badges.\\n   - Tapping a folder reveals grid or list views with duration badges, resolution pills (`1080p`, `4K`), playback progress bars, and multi-select actions (Add to Playlist, Move to Encrypted Vault, Delete, Share).\\n\\n2. **Playback & MX Gesture Controls**:\\n   - Tapping any media file launches the immersive player (auto-entering landscape or responsive theater mode).\\n   - Sliding a finger up/down on the **left side** adjusts brightness smoothly with an on-screen sun icon and percentage gauge.\\n   - Sliding a finger up/down on the **right side** adjusts volume smoothly with a speaker icon and percentage gauge (with 200% volume boost support).\\n   - Sliding horizontally scrubs the timeline with a time indicator (`+0:15 [12:45 / 45:10]`).\\n   - Quick toolbar provides immediate toggles: Decoder (`HW` / `SW`), Audio Track, Subtitle Settings modal, Aspect Ratio, Speed (`0.25x` to `3.0x`), Sleep Timer, and Screen Lock.\\n\\n3. **In-App Browser & M3U8 Stream Capture**:\\n   - Switching to the **Browser** tab opens a browser bar with address input and quick-link tiles.\\n   - When visiting or pasting stream links, a floating **\\\"Media Stream Detected\\\"** pill lights up.\\n   - Tapping **\\\"Download as MP4\\\"** reveals an interactive progress sheet tracking segment downloading (`42/180 segments (23%)`), stream bitrate, and remuxing.\\n   - Once completed, the file is added to the user\'s \\\"Stream Captures\\\" library with auto-generated thumbnail and metadata.\\n\\n4. **Private Encrypted Vault**:\\n   - The user taps the Lock icon or \\\"Private Folder\\\".\\n   - If not set up, they create a 4-digit PIN or 3x3 pattern.\\n   - Once authenticated, the encrypted library displays protected files. Adding a file encrypts the binary payload in IndexedDB and removes the plaintext original.\\n   - Pressing the **Emergency Disguise** button instantly morphs the interface into a functional Android Calculator. Entering the secret PIN on the calculator returns to the vault.\\n\\n### Visual Identity & Theme Tokens\\n\\n- **Aesthetic Direction**: Android Material 3 / MX Player signature dark & light modes. Sleek midnight obsidian (`#0c0f17`) for the media-first dark mode with electric cobalt/cyan accents (`#2563eb`, `#06b6d4`), paired with clean crisp white/slate (`#f8fafc`) for light mode.\\n- **Typography**: `Plus Jakarta Sans` for clean, high-legibility UI labels and Android-style headers; `JetBrains Mono` for tabular numerals, video timestamps, bitrates, and resolution specs.\\n- **Top Bar & Shell Contract**: Single-row 3-zone header with PlayThat! wordmark, device frame toggle (`Mobile / Responsive`), search bar trigger, and theme toggle.\\n- **Android Bottom Navigation Bar**: Fixed bottom tab bar (Folders, Playlists, Network Stream, In-App Browser, Encrypted Vault) with 48px touch targets, active icon tint, and smooth tab switching.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 3. Key Product Decisions & Trade-Offs\\n\\n| Decision | Chosen Approach | Rationale & Trade-Offs |\\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\\n| **HLS & Stream Playback Engine** | `hls.js` + Native HTML5 Media API + WebGL Shader FX | Provides broad support for M3U8 streaming, adaptive bitrate, audio track switching, and subtitle tracks, while WebGL canvas filters simulate hardware acceleration post-processing without heavy binary plugins. |\\n| **M3U8 Downloader & MP4 Remuxing** | Client-side HLS parser + segment fetcher + `mp4box` / muxing pipeline with Express proxy support for CORS-restricted streams | Allows in-browser segment retrieval and packaging into playable MP4 blobs. Server proxy endpoints (`/api/proxy-stream`) bypass CORS restrictions common to external M3U8 streams. |\\n| **Local Storage & Security Vault** | WebCrypto API (`PBKDF2` key derivation + `AES-GCM-256`) + `idb` (IndexedDB) | Ensures real, non-trivial cryptographic security for private files on the device. Data is encrypted in memory before disk write; without the PIN/passphrase, raw chunks remain unreadable. |\\n| **Device Frame Mockup** | Toggleable Android Device Frame with interactive notch, status bar, and gesture pill | Gives users the authentic feel of an Android smartphone/tablet app while preserving full desktop accessibility and responsive resizing when toggled off. |\\n| **Gesture Controls Engine** | Pointer and Touch event listeners with dual-zone spatial coordinate tracking | Allows intuitive brightness/volume gestures on both touchscreens and desktop trackpads/mice without requiring mobile-only browser APIs. |\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 4. Technical Architecture & Data Strategy\\n\\n```\\n\342\224\214\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\220\\n\342\224\202                        PlayThat! Mobile Shell                          \342\224\202\\n\342\224\202  \342\224\214\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\254\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\254\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\220  \342\224\202\\n\342\224\202  \342\224\202 Android Status Bar    \342\224\202 Device Frame Toggle  \342\224\202 Light/Dark Theme   \342\224\202  \342\224\202\\n\342\224\202  \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\264\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\264\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\230  \342\224\202\\n\342\224\202  \342\224\214\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\220  \342\224\202\\n\342\224\202  \342\224\202 Active View Router                                               \342\224\202  \342\224\202\\n\342\224\202  \342\224\202 \342\224\234\342\224\200 Folders & Local Media Browser (Thumbnail Grid, Metadata)      \342\224\202  \342\224\202\\n\342\224\202  \342\224\202 \342\224\234\342\224\200 Immersive MX Gesture Player (Dual-Edge Swipes, WebGL Filters) \342\224\202  \342\224\202\\n\342\224\202  \342\224\202 \342\224\234\342\224\200 In-App Chromium Browser (Stream Sniffer & M3U8-to-MP4 Muxer)  \342\224\202  \342\224\202\\n\342\224\202  \342\224\202 \342\224\234\342\224\200 Local & Network Streaming (HTTP, HLS, RTSP/M3U8 URLs)         \342\224\202  \342\224\202\\n\342\224\202  \342\224\202 \342\224\234\342\224\200 Playlist & Queue Manager (Drag-and-Drop, Reorder, Loop)       \342\224\202  \342\224\202\\n\342\224\202  \342\224\202 \342\224\224\342\224\200 Encrypted Private Vault (AES-GCM, PIN/Pattern Lock, Disguise) \342\224\202  \342\224\202\\n\342\224\202  \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\230  \342\224\202\\n\342\224\202  \342\224\214\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\220  \342\224\202\\n\342\224\202  \342\224\202 Android Bottom Navigation (Folders | Stream | Browser | Vault)    \342\224\202  \342\224\202\\n\342\224\202  \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\2