            lines {
              text: "A high-performance, MX Player-inspired Android media playback and stream capture experience. Features dual-edge vertical and horizontal gesture controls, extensive subtitle customization, hardware/software decoding toggles, an in-app browser with live M3U8 stream sniffing and MP4 conversion, network and local media streaming, and an AES-GCM encrypted private media vault with PIN/pattern authentication and emergency disguise."
