            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "## 2. User Experience & Visual Design"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "### Key User Flows"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "1. **Browsing & Folder Navigation**:"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "   - The user opens PlayThat! and lands on the **Folders / Videos** view styled with Android Material You + MX Player card aesthetic."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "   - Folders (e.g., *Camera, Downloads, Stream Captures, Movies, Series*) display video counts and unread badges."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "   - Tapping a folder reveals grid or list views with duration badges, resolution pills (`1080p`, `4K`), playback progress bars, and multi-select actions (Add to Playlist, Move to Encrypted Vault, Delete, Share)."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "2. **Playback & MX Gesture Controls**:"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "   - Tapping any media file launches the immersive player (auto-entering landscape or responsive theater mode)."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "   - Sliding a finger up/down on the **left side** adjusts brightness smoothly with an on-screen sun icon and percentage gauge."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "   - Sliding a finger up/down on the **right side** adjusts volume smoothly with a speaker icon and percentage gauge (with 200% volume boost support)."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "   - Sliding horizontally scrubs the timeline with a time indicator (`+0:15 [12:45 / 45:10]`)."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "   - Quick toolbar provides immediate toggles: Decoder (`HW` / `SW`), Audio Track, Subtitle Settings modal, Aspect Ratio, Speed (`0.25x` to `3.0x`), Sleep Timer, and Screen Lock."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "3. **In-App Browser & M3U8 Stream Capture**:"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "   - Switching to the **Browser** tab opens a browser bar with address input and quick-link tiles."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "   - When visiting or pasting stream links, a floating **\"Media Stream Detected\"** pill lights up."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "   - Tapping **\"Download as MP4\"** reveals an interactive progress sheet tracking segment downloading (`42/180 segments (23%)`), stream bitrate, and remuxing."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "   - Once completed, the file is added to the user\'s \"Stream Captures\" library with auto-generated thumbnail and metadata."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "4. **Private Encrypted Vault**:"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "   - The user taps the Lock icon or \"Private Folder\"."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "   - If not set up, they create a 4-digit PIN or 3x3 pattern."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "   - Once authenticated, the encrypted library displays protected files. Adding a file encrypts the binary payload in IndexedDB and removes the plaintext original."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "   - Pressing the **Emergency Disguise** button instantly morphs the interface into a functional Android Calculator. Entering the secret PIN on the calculator returns to the vault."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "### Visual Identity & Theme Tokens"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Aesthetic Direction**: Android Material 3 / MX Player signature dark & light modes. Sleek midnight obsidian (`#0c0f17`) for the media-first dark mode with electric cobalt/cyan accents (`#2563eb`, `#06b6d4`), paired with clean crisp white/slate (`#f8fafc`) for light mode."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Typography**: `Plus Jakarta Sans` for clean, high-legibility UI labels and Android-style headers; `JetBrains Mono` for tabular numerals, video timestamps, bitrates, and resolution specs."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Top Bar & Shell Contract**: Single-row 3-zone header with PlayThat! wordmark, device frame toggle (`Mobile / Responsive`), search bar trigger, and theme toggle."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Android Bottom Navigation Bar**: Fixed bottom tab bar (Folders, Playlists, Network Stream, In-App Browser, Encrypted Vault) with 48px touch targets, active icon tint, and smooth tab switching."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "---"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "## 3. Key Product Decisions & Trade-Offs"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "| Decision | Chosen Approach | Rationale & Trade-Offs |"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "| :--- | :--- | :--- |"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "| **HLS & Stream Playback Engine** | `hls.js` + Native HTML5 Media API + WebGL Shader FX | Provides broad support for M3U8 streaming, adaptive bitrate, audio track switching, and subtitle tracks, while WebGL canvas filters simulate hardware acceleration post-processing without heavy binary plugins. |"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "| **M3U8 Downloader & MP4 Remuxing** | Client-side HLS parser + segment fetcher + muxing pipeline with Express proxy support for CORS-restricted streams | Allows in-browser segment retrieval and packaging into playable MP4 blobs. Server proxy endpoints (`/api/stream-proxy`) bypass CORS restrictions common to external M3U8 streams. |"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "| **Local Storage & Security Vault** | WebCrypto API (`PBKDF2` key derivation + `AES-GCM-256`) + `idb` (IndexedDB) | Ensures real, non-trivial cryptographic security for private files on the device. Data is encrypted in memory before disk write; without the PIN/passphrase, raw chunks remain unreadable. |"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "| **Device Frame Mockup** | Toggleable Android Device Frame with interactive notch, status bar, and gesture pill | Gives users the authentic feel of an Android smartphone/tablet app while preserving full desktop accessibility and responsive resizing when toggled off. |"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "| **Gesture Controls Engine** | Pointer and Touch event listeners with dual-zone spatial coordinate tracking | Allows intuitive brightness/volume gestures on both touchscreens and desktop trackpads/mice without requiring mobile-only browser APIs. |"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "---"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "## 4. Technical Architecture & Data Strategy"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
