  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing Download Manager Functionality**\n\nI\'m now diving into the specifics of a UC Browser-style download manager. I need to unpack its key features. I\'m taking notes on its ability to download MP4s directly and other essential capabilities. This will help with properly building a robust app.\n\n\n**Defining Download Manager Features**\n\nI\'ve outlined core components: multi-tasking tabs for active, paused, and completed downloads, direct MP4 and M3U8 download support with pause/resume functionality, and concurrent download management with individual actions. Progress notifications are planned with completion alerts. Integration with PlayThat! will automatically add downloaded MP4s with metadata and \"Play Now\" functionality. I\'m also including a batch download feature and a configurable speed limit / turbo boost option. I\'ve started updating `src/types/index.ts` with relevant UC download task models for direct and M3U8 downloads.\n\n\n**Implementing Download Manager Logic**\n\nI\'m now focusing on the implementation details. I\'m building out `src/services/downloadManagerService.ts` to manage MP4 blob downloads and IndexedDB storage with pause, resume, and cancellation features. UI-wise, I\'m considering `src/components/DownloadManagerModal.tsx` or `src/components/UCDownloadManager.tsx` with a UC Browser-style interface. I\'m planning tabs, a turbo boost toggle, an \"Add New Download\" modal, and detailed progress displays with speed, time remaining, and downloaded bytes.\n\n\n**Defining App Features**\n\nI\'m now integrating network stream URL input and custom playlist management features. I\'m focusing on `src/App.tsx` to connect everything. The top bar will feature PlayThat! branding, Android Frame mode, dark/light mode, a search bar, a UC Download Manager trigger, and settings. I\'m planning Android bottom navigation with Media, Browser, Downloads, Playlists, and Vault sections. I\'ll need to define detailed view components, so I\'m thinking fullscreen/MX Player views with gesture controls and decoder toggles. I need to update `src/types/index.ts` with these new download manager types.\n\n\n"
