  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining Browser Architecture**\n\nI\'m currently structuring the core components of the in-app browser, starting with a defined maximum tab limit using `MAX_TABS`. I\'ve also set up a `TabItem` interface for managing tab data: title, URL, ID, and any detected metadata. The architecture will include initial state and basic functionalities to support tab management, and I\'m starting to think about supporting interactions with the tabs and the browser itself.\n\n\n**Designing Tab Navigation**\n\nI\'m now focusing on tab navigation, defining the UI components in the browser header. There will be a horizontal tab strip with titles and close buttons, scrollable if necessary. A \"+\" button will create new tabs, with a tooltip if the maximum tab limit is reached. I\'m also adding a mobile tab counter that toggles the Android Tab Grid Switcher. Additionally, navigation controls like back, forward, refresh, and home buttons are in progress, along with an address bar. I am considering quick stream hub bookmarks, too.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_267454"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"import React, { useState } from \'react\';\\nimport {\\n  ArrowLeft,\\n  ArrowRight,\\n  RotateCcw,\\n  Search,\\n  Globe,\\n  Download,\\n  Play,\\n  CheckCircle2,\\n  AlertCircle,\\n  ExternalLink,\\n  Radio,\\n  FileVideo,\\n  X,\\n  Compass,\\n  Plus,\\n  Layers,\\n  Copy,\\n  Trash2,\\n} from \'lucide-react\';\\nimport { SAMPLE_STREAM_BOOKMARKS } from \'../data/sampleMedia\';\\nimport { sniffMediaStreams, downloadM3U8Stream } from \'../services/m3u8Downloader\';\\nimport { M3U8DownloadTask, MediaItem } from \'../types\';\\n\\nconst MAX_TABS = 40;\\n\\nexport interface BrowserTab {\\n  id: string;\\n  title: string;\\n  url: string;\\n  detectedStreams: Array<{ url: string; type: string; label: string }>;\\n  createdAt: number;\\n}\\n\\ninterface InAppBrowserProps {\\n  onPlayMedia: (item: MediaItem) => void;\\n  onSaveToLibrary: (item: MediaItem) => void;\\n}\\n\\nexport const InAppBrowser: React.FC<InAppBrowserProps> = ({\\n  onPlayMedia,\\n  onSaveToLibrary,\\n}) => {\\n  // Tabs management state (up to 40 tabs)\\n  const [tabs, setTabs] = useState<BrowserTab[]>([\\n    {\\n      id: \'tab-1\',\\n      title: \'Mux HLS Test Feed\',\\n      url: \'https://test-streams.mux.dev/x36xhzz/x36xhzz.m3u8\',\\n      detectedStreams: [\\n        {\\n          url: \'https://test-streams.mux.dev/x36xhzz/x36xhzz.m3u8\',\\n          type: \'m3u8\',\\n          label: \'Mux HLS Adaptive Stream (Big Buck Bunny)\',\\n        },\\n      ],\\n      createdAt: Date.now(),\\n    },\\n  ]);\\n\\n  const [activeTabId, setActiveTabId] = useState<string>(\'tab-1\');\\n  const [showTabGrid, setShowTabGrid] = useState<boolean>(false);\\n  const [tabLimitAlert, setTabLimitAlert] = useState<string | null>(null);\\n\\n  // Active tab reference\\n  const currentTab = tabs.find((t) => t.id === activeTabId) || tabs[0];\\n  const [urlInput, setUrlInput] = useState<string>(currentTab?.url || \'\');\\n\\n  // Download & remux state\\n  const [activeDownloadTask, setActiveDownloadTask] = useState<M3U8DownloadTask | null>(null);\\n  const [abortController, setAbortController] = useState<AbortController | null>(null);\\n  const [completedItem, setCompletedItem] = useState<MediaItem | null>(null);\\n\\n  // Switch active tab\\n  const handleSwitchTab = (tabId: string) => {\\n    setActiveTabId(tabId);\\n    const target = tabs.find((t) => t.id === tabId);\\n    if (target) {\\n      setUrlInput(target.url);\\n    }\\n    setShowTabGrid(false);\\n  };\\n\\n  // Open new tab (up to 40)\\n  const handleNewTab = (defaultUrl?: string, defaultTitle?: string) => {\\n    if (tabs.length >= MAX_TABS) {\\n      setTabLimitAlert(`Maximum tab limit of ${MAX_TABS} reached. Please close a tab to open a new one.`);\\n      setTimeout(() => setTabLimitAlert(null), 3500);\\n      return;\\n    }\\n\\n    const newUrl = defaultUrl || \'https://test-streams.mux.dev/x36xhzz/x36xhzz.m3u8\';\\n    const newTitle = defaultTitle || `New Tab ${tabs.length + 1}`;\\n    const detected = sniffMediaStreams(newUrl);\\n\\n    const newTab: BrowserTab = {\\n      id: `tab-${Date.now()}-${Math.random().toString(36).substring(2, 5)}`,\\n      title: newTitle,\\n      url: newUrl,\\n      detectedStreams: detected,\\n      createdAt: Date.now(),\\n    };\\n\\n    setTabs((prev) => [...prev, newTab]);\\n    setActiveTabId(newTab.id);\\n    setUrlInput(newUrl);\\n    setShowTabGrid(false);\\n  };\\n\\n  // Close tab\\n  const handleCloseTab = (tabId: string, e?: React.MouseEvent) => {\\n    e?.stopPropagation();\\n    if (tabs.length <= 1) {\\n      // Keep at least 1 tab open, reset to home\\n      const resetTab: BrowserTab = {\\n        id: `tab-${Date.now()}`,\\n        title: \'New Tab\',\\n        url: \'https://test-streams.mux.dev/x36xhzz/x36xhzz.m3u8\',\\n        detectedStreams: sniffMediaStreams(\'https://test-streams.mux.dev/x36xhzz/x36xhzz.m3u8\'),\\n        createdAt: Date.now(),\\n      };\\n      setTabs([resetTab]);\\n      setActiveTabId(resetTab.id);\\n      setUrlInput(resetTab.url);\\n      return;\\n    }\\n\\n    const filtered = tabs.filter((t) => t.id !== tabId);\\n    setTabs(filtered);\\n\\n    if (activeTabId === tabId) {\\n      const nextActive = filtered[filtered.length - 1];\\n      setActiveTabId(nextActive.id);\\n      setUrlInput(nextActive.url);\\n    }\\n  };\\n\\n  // Close all tabs\\n  const handleCloseAllTabs = () => {\\n    const singleTab: BrowserTab = {\\n      id: `tab-${Date.now()}`,\\n      title: \'New Tab\',\\n      url: \'https://test-streams.mux.dev/x36xhzz/x36xhzz.m3u8\',\\n      detectedStreams: sniffMediaStreams(\'https://test-streams.mux.dev/x36xhzz/x36xhzz.m3u8\'),\\n      createdAt: Date.now(),\\n    };\\n    setTabs([singleTab]);\\n    setActiveTabId(singleTab.id);\\n    setUrlInput(singleTab.url);\\n    setShowTabGrid(false);\\n  };\\n\\n  // Navigate active tab\\n  const handleNavigate = (targetUrl: string) => {\\n    setUrlInput(targetUrl);\\n    const detected = sniffMediaStreams(targetUrl);\\n    const fileName = targetUrl.split(\'/\').pop()?.split(\'?\')[0] || \'Web Stream\';\\n\\n    setTabs((prev) =>\\n      prev.map((t) =>\\n        t.id === activeTabId\\n          ? {\\n              ...t,\\n              url: targetUrl,\\n              title: decodeURIComponent(fileName),\\n              detectedStreams: detected,\\n            }\\n          : t\\n      )\\n    );\\n  };\\n\\n  const handleSearchSubmit = (e: React.FormEvent) => {\\n    e.preventDefault();\\n    let query = urlInput.trim();\\n    if (!query) return;\\n\\n    if (!query.startsWith(\'http://\') && !query.startsWith(\'https://\')) {\\n      if (query.includes(\'.\') && !query.includes(\' \')) {\\n        query = `https://${query}`;\\n      } else {\\n        query = `https://test-streams.mux.dev/x36xhzz/x36xhzz.m3u8`;\\n      }\\n    }\\n\\n    handleNavigate(query);\\n  };\\n\\n  const startDownloadAndConvert = async (streamUrl: string, streamLabel: string) => {\\n    const controller = new AbortController();\\n    setAbortController(controller);\\n    setCompletedItem(null);\\n\\n    try {\\n      const res = await downloadM3U8Stream(\\n        streamUrl,\\n        streamLabel,\\n        (task) => {\\n          setActiveDownloadTask(task);\\n        },\\n        controller.signal\\n      );\\n\\n      const newItem: MediaItem = {\\n        id: `m3u8-dl-${Date.now()}`,\\n        title: streamLabel || \'Converted HLS Stream\',\\n        folder: \'Stream Captures\',\\n        sourceType: \'downloaded\',\\n        url: res.blobUrl,\\n        thumbnailUrl: \'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1534447677768-be436bb09401?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80\',\\n        duration: res.duration || 60,\\n        currentTime: 0,\\n        resolution: \'1080p Remuxed\',\\n        fileSize: res.size,\\n        codec: \'MP4 / H.264 AAC\',\\n        decoder: \'HW\',\\n        createdAt: Date.now(),\\n        isFavorite: false,\\n        isEncrypted: false,\\n      };\\n\\n      setCompletedItem(newItem);\\n      onSaveToLibrary(newItem);\\n    } catch (err: any) {\\n      console.error(\'Download error:\', err);\\n    }\\n  };\\n\\n  const cancelDownload = () => {\\n    if (abortController) {\\n      abortController.abort();\\n      setAbortController(null);\\n    }\\n    setActiveDownloadTask(null);\\n  };\\n\\n  return (\\n    <div className=\\\"flex-1 w-full flex flex-col bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 overflow-hidden relative\\\">\\n      {/* Tab Limit Alert Toast */}\\n      {tabLimitAlert && (\\n        <div className=\\\"absolute top-16 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 z-50 px-4 py-2 bg-red-900 text-white rounded-full text-xs font-semibold shadow-xl border border-red-700 animate-in fade-in duration-200\\\">\\n          {tabLimitAlert}\\n        </div>\\n      )}\\n\\n      {/* Chromium Desktop/Tablet Horizontal Tab Strip */}\\n      <div className=\\\"bg-slate-950 px-2 pt-2 border-b border-slate-800 flex items-center justify-between gap-2 shrink-0 select-none\\\">\\n        <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-1 overflow-x-auto flex-1 pb-1 scrollbar-none\\\">\\n          {tabs.map((tab) => {\\n            const isActive = tab.id === activeTabId;\\n            return (\\n              <div\\n                key={tab.id}\\n                onClick={() => handleSwitchTab(tab.id)}\\n                className={`group max-w-[170px] min-w-[100px] h-9 px-3 rounded-t-xl text-xs flex items-center justify-between gap-1.5 cursor-pointer transition-all border-t border-x shrink-0 ${\\n                  isActive\\n                    ? \'bg-slate-900 text-white border-slate-700 font-bold shadow-sm\'\\n                    : \'bg-slate-950/70 text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-200 border-transparent hover:bg-slate-900/40\'\\n                }`}\\n              >\\n                <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-1.5 min-w-0\\\">\\n                  <Globe className={`w-3.5 h-3.5 shrink-0 ${isActive ? \'text-blue-400\' : \'text-slate-500\'}`} />\\n                  <span className=\\\"truncate\\\">{tab.title}</span>\\n                </div>\\n                <button\\n                  onClick={(e) => handleCloseTab(tab.id, e)}\\n                  className=\\\"p-0.5 rounded-full hover:bg-slate-800 text-slate-500 hover:text-white shrink-0\\\"\\n                  title=\\\"Close tab\\\"\\n                >\\n                  <X className=\\\"w-3 h-3\\\" />\\n                </button>\\n              </div>\\n            );\\n          })}\\n\\n          {/* New Tab Button */}\\n          <button\\n            onClick={() => handleNewTab()}\\n            disabled={tabs.length >= MAX_TABS}\\n            className=\\\"p-1.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-900 hover:bg-slate-800 text-slate-300 hover:text-white transition-colors border border-slate-800 shrink-0 disabled:opacity-40\\\"\\n            title={tabs.length >= MAX_TABS ? \'Maximum 40 tabs reached\' : \'Open new tab\'}\\n          >\\n            <Plus className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5\\\" />\\n          </button>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        {/* Android Tab Grid Switcher Button (Square badge like Chrome Android) */}\\n        <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-1.5 shrink-0 pb-1\\\">\\n          <button\\n            onClick={() => setShowTabGrid(!showTabGrid)}\\n            className=\\\"h-8 px-2.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-900 hover:bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 text-xs font-mono font-bold text-blue-400 flex items-center gap-1 transition-colors shadow-sm\\\"\\n            title=\\\"Tab Switcher Overview (up to 40 tabs)\\\"\\n          >\\n            <Layers className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5\\\" />\\n            <span>{tabs.length}</span>\\n            <span className=\\\"text-[10px] text-slate-500 font-normal\\\">/{MAX_TABS}</span>\\n          </button>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      {/* Chromium App Bar & Omnibox */}\\n      <div className=\\\"p-3 bg-slate-900 border-b border-slate-800 flex flex-col gap-2 shrink-0\\\">\\n        <form onSubmit={handleSearchSubmit} className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2\\\">\\n          <div className=\\\"flex items-center text-slate-400 shrink-0\\\">\\n            <button\\n              type=\\\"button\\\"\\n              className=\\\"p-1.5 rounded-lg hover:bg-slate-800 hover:text-white transition-colors\\\"\\n              title=\\\"Back\\\"\\n            >\\n              <ArrowLeft className=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" />\\n            </button>\\n            <button\\n              type=\\\"button\\\"\\n              className=\\\"p-1.5 rounded-lg hover:bg-slate-800 hover:text-white transition-colors\\\"\\n              title=\\\"Forward\\\"\\n            >\\n              <ArrowRight className=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" />\\n            </button>\\n            <button\\n              type=\\\"button\\\"\\n              onClick={() => handleNavigate(currentTab?.url || urlInput)}\\n              className=\\\"p-1.5 rounded-lg hover:bg-slate-800 hover:text-white transition-colors\\\"\\n              title=\\\"Refresh\\\"\\n            >\\n              <RotateCcw className=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" />\\n            </button>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          {/* Omnibox URL Field */}\\n          <div className=\\\"flex-1 relative flex items-center\\\">\\n            <Globe className=\\\"absolute left-3 w-4 h-4 text-slate-400 pointer-events-none\\\" />\\n            <input\\n              type=\\\"text\\\"\\n              value={urlInput}\\n              onChange={(e) => setUrlInput(e.target.value)}\\n              placeholder=\\\"Enter stream link, M3U8 URL, or search...\\\"\\n              className=\\\"w-full pl-9 pr-8 py-2 bg-slate-950/90 border border-slate-700 rounded-xl text-xs font-mono text-slate-100 placeholder:text-slate-500 focus:outline-none focus:border-blue-500 transition-colors shadow-inner\\\"\\n            />\\n            {urlInput && (\\n              <button\\n                type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                onClick={() => setUrlInput(\'\')}\\n                className=\\\"absolute right-2.5 p-0.5 rounded-full hover:bg-slate-800 text-slate-400\\\"\\n              >\\n                <X className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5\\\" />\\n              </button>\\n            )}\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <button\\n            type=\\\"submit\\\"\\n            className=\\\"px-4 py-2 bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-500 rounded-xl text-xs font-semibold text-white transition-colors shadow-sm shrink-0\\\"\\n          >\\n            Sniff & Go\\n          </button>\\n        </form>\\n\\n        {/* Quick Stream Bookmarks */}\\n        <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-1.5 overflow-x-auto pb-0.5 text-xs\\\">\\n          <span className=\\\"text-[10px] font-mono uppercase text-slate-500 shrink-0 mr-1 flex items-center gap-1\\\">\\n            <Compass className=\\\"w-3 h-3 text-cyan-400\\\" />\\n            Stream Hub:\\n          </span>\\n          {SAMPLE_STREAM_BOOKMARKS.map((bm, idx) => (\\n            <button\\n              key={idx}\\n              onClick={() => handleNavigate(bm.url)}\\n              className=\\\"px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-slate-800/80 hover:bg-slate-700/80 border border-slate-700/70 text-slate-300 hover:text-white whitespace-nowrap shrink-0 transition-colors flex items-center gap-1.5\\\"\\n            >\\n              <span>{bm.title}</span>\\n              <span className=\\\"text-[9px] px-1 py-0.2 bg-blue-900/60 text-blue-300 rounded font-mono\\\">\\n                {bm.badge}\\n              </span>\\n            </button>\\n          ))}\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      {/* Main Content Area */}\\n      <div className=\\\"flex-1 overflow-y-auto p-4 flex flex-col gap-4\\\">\\n        {/* Active Stream Sniffer Banner for Current Tab */}\\n        {currentTab?.detectedStreams && currentTab.detectedStreams.length > 0 && (\\n          <div className=\\\"p-4 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-950/70 via-slate-900 to-cyan-950/70 border border-blue-500/40 shadow-xl flex flex-col gap-3\\\">\\n            <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between\\\">\\n              <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2\\\">\\n                <span className=\\\"relative flex h-2.5 w-2.5\\\">\\n                  <span className=\\\"animate-ping absolute inline-flex h-full w-full rounded-full bg-cyan-400 opacity-75\\\"></span>\\n                  <span className=\\\"relative inline-flex rounded-full h-2.5 w-2.5 bg-cyan-500\\\"></span>\\n                </span>\\n                <span className=\\\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-cyan-300 flex items-center gap-1.5\\\">\\n                  <Radio className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5\\\" />\\n                  Media Stream Sniffer Active (Tab {tabs.findIndex((t) => t.id === activeTabId) + 1})\\n                </span>\\n              </div>\\n              <span className=\\\"text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-400\\\">\\n                {currentTab.detectedStreams.length} stream(s) ready\\n              </span>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            <div className=\\\"flex flex-col gap-2\\\">\\n              {currentTab.detectedStreams.map((st, i) => (\\n                <div\\n                  key={i}\\n                  className=\\\"p-3 bg-slate-900/90 rounded-xl border border-slate-800 flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-3\\\"\\n                >\\n                  <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-3 min-w-0\\\">\\n                    <div className=\\\"w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-blue-600/20 border border-blue-500/30 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 text-blue-400\\\">\\n                      <FileVideo className=\\\"w-5 h-5\\\" />\\n                    </div>\\n                    <div className=\\\"flex flex-col min-w-0\\\">\\n                      <span className=\\\"text-xs font-semibold text-white truncate\\\">\\n                        {st.label}\\n                      </span>\\n                      <span className=\\\"text-[10px] font-mono text-slate-400 truncate max-w-xs\\\">\\n                        {st.url}\\n                      </span>\\n                    </div>\\n                  </div>\\n\\n                  <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2 shrink-0\\\">\\n                    <button\\n                      onClick={() =>\\n                        onPlayMedia({\\n                          id: `stream-${Date.now()}`,\\n                          title: st.label,\\n                          folder: \'Stream Captures\',\\n                          sourceType: \'stream\',\\n                          url: st.url,\\n                          thumbnailUrl:\\n                            \'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1534447677768-be436bb09401?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80\',\\n                          duration: 300,\\n                          currentTime: 0,\\n                          resolution: \'HLS Live Stream\',\\n                          fileSize: 150000000,\\n                          codec: \'HLS / AAC\',\\n                          decoder: \'HW\',\\n                          createdAt: Date.now(),\\n                          isFavorite: true,\\n                          isEncrypted: false,\\n                        })\\n                      }\\n                      className=\\\"px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold rounded-lg bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-white flex items-center gap-1.5 border border-slate-700 transition-colors\\\"\\n                    >\\n                      <Play className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5 text-blue-400 fill-blue-400\\\" />\\n                      <span>Play Stream</span>\\n                    </button>\\n\\n                    <button\\n                      onClick={() => startDownloadAndConvert(st.url, st.label)}\\n                      className=\\\"px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold rounded-lg bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-500 text-white flex items-center gap-1.5 transition-colors shadow-sm\\\"\\n                    >\\n                      <Download className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5\\\" />\\n                      <span>Download as MP4</span>\\n                    </button>\\n                  </div>\\n                </div>\\n              ))}\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        )}\\n\\n        {/* Live Download & Remuxing Progress */}\\n        {activeDownloadTask && (\\n          <div className=\\\"p-5 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 shadow-2xl flex flex-col gap-4\\\">\\n            <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between\\\">\\n              <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2\\\">\\n                <Download className=\\\"w-5 h-5 text-blue-400 animate-bounce\\\" />\\n                <h4 className=\\\"text-sm font-bold text-white\\\">\\n                  M3U8 to MP4 Segment Remuxer\\n                </h4>\\n              </div>\\n              {activeDownloadTask.status === \'completed\' ? (\\n                <span className=\\\"text-xs font-medium text-emerald-400 flex items-center gap-1\\\">\\n                  <CheckCircle2 className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5\\\" />\\n                  Completed\\n                </span>\\n              ) : activeDownloadTask.status === \'error\' ? (\\n                <span className=\\\"text-xs font-medium text-red-400 flex items-center gap-1\\\">\\n                  <AlertCircle className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5\\\" />\\n                  Download Failed\\n                </span>\\n              ) : (\\n                <button\\n                  onClick={cancelDownload}\\n                  className=\\\"text-xs text-slate-400 hover:text-red-400\\\"\\n                >\\n                  Cancel\\n                </button>\\n              )}\\n            </div>\\n\\n            <div className=\\\"text-xs text-slate-300 font-medium truncate\\\">\\n              {activeDownloadTask.title}\\n            </div>\\n\\n            {/* Progress Bar */}\\n            <div className=\\\"flex flex-col gap-1.5\\\">\\n              <div className=\\\"w-full h-2.5 bg-slate-800 rounded-full overflow-hidden p-0.5\\\">\\n                <div\\n                  className=\\\"h-full bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-500 to-cyan-400 rounded-full transition-all duration-200\\\"\\n                  style={{\\n                    width: `${\\n                      activeDownloadTask.totalSegments > 0\\n                        ? Math.min(\\n                            100,\\n                            (activeDownloadTask.downloadedSegments /\\n                              activeDownloadTask.totalSegments) *\\n                              100\\n                          )\\n                        : 5\\n                    }%`,\\n                  }}\\n                />\\n              </div>\\n\\n              <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-400\\\">\\n                <span>\\n                  {activeDownloadTask.status === \'muxing\'\\n                    ? \'Packaging TS chunks into MP4 container...\'\\n                    : activeDownloadTask.status === \'completed\'\\n                    ? \'MP4 conversion ready & verified\'\\n                    : `Segment ${activeDownloadTask.downloadedSegments} / ${activeDownloadTask.totalSegments}`}\\n                </span>\\n                <span>\\n                  {activeDownloadTask.speedKbps > 0 && `${activeDownloadTask.speedKbps} KB/s`}\\n                </span>\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            {/* Completion Actions */}\\n            {completedItem && (\\n              <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-3 pt-2 border-t border-slate-800\\\">\\n                <button\\n                  onClick={() => onPlayMedia(completedItem)}\\n                  className=\\\"flex-1 py-2 rounded-xl bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-500 text-white text-xs font-semibold flex items-center justify-center gap-2 shadow-md transition-colors\\\"\\n                >\\n                  <Play className=\\\"w-4 h-4 fill-white\\\" />\\n                  <span>Play Converted MP4</span>\\n                </button>\\n                <a\\n                  href={completedItem.url}\\n                  download={`${completedItem.title.replace(/\\\\s+/g, \'_\')}.mp4`}\\n                  className=\\\"py-2 px-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-200 text-xs font-semibold flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 transition-colors\\\"\\n                >\\n                  <Download className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5\\\" />\\n                  <span>Save to Disk</span>\\n                </a>\\n              </div>\\n            )}\\n          </div>\\n        )}\\n\\n        {/* Embedded Browser Viewport */}\\n        <div className=\\\"flex-1 min-h-[300px] rounded-2xl bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 p-5 flex flex-col justify-between\\\">\\n          <div className=\\\"flex flex-col gap-2\\\">\\n            <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-slate-400\\\">\\n              <span className=\\\"truncate max-w-sm\\\">Active Tab URL: {currentTab?.url}</span>\\n              <span className=\\\"font-mono text-[10px] text-emerald-400\\\">Tabs: {tabs.length}/{MAX_TABS}</span>\\n            </div>\\n            <p className=\\\"text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed\\\">\\n              PlayThat! in-app multi-tab browser supports opening up to <strong>40 simultaneous tabs</strong>. Each tab maintains independent stream sniffing, history, and downloads.\\n            </p>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div className=\\\"p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800 flex items-center justify-between text-xs\\\">\\n            <div className=\\\"flex flex-col\\\">\\n              <span className=\\\"font-semibold text-white\\\">Chromium Engine & Stream Pipeline</span>\\n              <span className=\\\"text-[11px] text-slate-400\\\">\\n                Multi-tab browsing with auto-detection of .m3u8, .mp4, and adaptive HLS video feeds\\n              </span>\\n            </div>\\n            <button\\n              onClick={() => handleNewTab()}\\n              disabled={tabs.length >= MAX_TABS}\\n              className=\\\"px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-500 text-white text-xs font-semibold transition-colors disabled:opacity-40\\\"\\n            >\\n              + New Tab\\n            </button>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      {/* Android Tab Grid Switcher Modal (Like Chrome Android / UC Browser) */}\\n      {showTabGrid && (\\n        <div className=\\\"absolute inset-0 z-50 bg-slate-950/95 backdrop-blur-md flex flex-col p-4 animate-in fade-in zoom-in-95 duration-150\\\">\\n          {/* Grid Switcher Header */}\\n          <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-slate-800 pb-3 mb-4 shrink-0\\\">\\n            <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2\\\">\\n              <Layers className=\\\"w-5 h-5 text-blue-400\\\" />\\n              <div>\\n                <h3 className=\\\"text-sm font-bold text-white leading-tight\\\">\\n                  Open Tabs ({tabs.length} / {MAX_TABS})\\n                </h3>\\n                <span className=\\\"text-[10px] text-slate-400\\\">\\n                  Select a tab to switch or close\\n                </span>\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2\\\">\\n              <button\\n                onClick={() => handleNewTab()}\\n                disabled={tabs.length >= MAX_TABS}\\n                className=\\\"px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-500 text-white text-xs font-semibold flex items-center gap-1 transition-colors disabled:opacity-40\\\"\\n              >\\n                <Plus className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5\\\" />\\n                <span>New Tab</span>\\n              </button>\\n\\n              <button\\n                onClick={handleCloseAllTabs}\\n                className=\\\"px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-800 hover:bg-red-950 text-slate-300 hover:text-red-400 text-xs font-medium transition-colors border border-slate-700\\\"\\n              >\\n                Close All\\n              </button>\\n\\n              <button\\n                onClick={() => setShowTabGrid(false)}\\n                className=\\\"p-1.5 rounded-full hover:bg-slate-800 text-slate-400 hover:text-white\\\"\\n              >\\n                <X className=\\\"w-5 h-5\\\" />\\n              </button>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          {/* Tab Cards Grid */}\\n          <div className=\\\"flex-1 overflow-y-auto grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 md:grid-cols-4 gap-3 pr-1\\\">\\n            {tabs.map((tab, idx) => {\\n              const isActive = tab.id === activeTabId;\\n              return (\\n                <div\\n                  key={tab.id}\\n                  onClick={() => handleSwitchTab(tab.id)}\\n                  className={`group relative rounded-2xl border p-3 flex flex-col justify-between cursor-pointer transition-all hover:scale-[1.02] min-h-[140px] ${\\n                    isActive\\n                      ? \'bg-blue-950/40 border-blue-500 ring-2 ring-blue-500/30\'\\n                      : \'bg-slate-900 border-slate-800 hover:border-slate-700\'\\n                  }`}\\n                >\\n                  {/* Card Top Title & Close Button */}\\n                  <div className=\\\"flex items-start justify-between gap-1.5\\\">\\n                    <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-1.5 min-w-0\\\">\\n                      <span className=\\\"w-5 h-5 rounded-md bg-slate-800 text-[10px] font-mono font-bold flex items-center justify-center text-slate-400 shrink-0\\\">\\n                        {idx + 1}\\n                      </span>\\n                      <span className=\\\"text-xs font-bold text-white truncate max-w-[100px]\\\">\\n                        {tab.title}\\n                      </span>\\n                    </div>\\n\\n                    <button\\n                      onClick={(e) => handleCloseTab(tab.id, e)}\\n                      className=\\\"p-1 rounded-full hover:bg-slate-800 text-slate-400 hover:text-red-400 shrink-0\\\"\\n                      title=\\\"Close\\\"\\n                    >\\n                      <X className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5\\\" />\\n                    </button>\\n                  </div>\\n\\n                  {/* Card Middle URL Preview */}\\n                  <div className=\\\"my-2 p-2 rounded-xl bg-slate-950/70 border border-slate-800/80 text-[10px] font-mono text-slate-400 break-all line-clamp-2\\\">\\n                    {tab.url}\\n                  </div>\\n\\n                  {/* Card Footer Status */}\\n                  <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between text-[10px] pt-1 border-t border-slate-800/50\\\">\\n                    <span className=\\\"text-cyan-400 flex items-center gap-1\\\">\\n                      <Radio className=\\\"w-3 h-3\\\" />\\n                      {tab.detectedStreams.length} stream(s)\\n                    </span>\\n                    {isActive && (\\n                      <span className=\\\"px-1.5 py-0.2 rounded bg-blue-600 text-white font-semibold\\\">\\n                        Active\\n                      </span>\\n                    )}\\n                  </div>\\n                </div>\\n              );\\n            })}\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      )}\\n    </div>\\n  );\\n};\\n\", \"Description\":\"Implement multi-tab browser supporting up to 40 simultaneous tabs with grid switcher\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/components/InAppBrowser.tsx\", \"toolAction\":\"Updating InAppBrowser.tsx\", \"toolSummary\":\"Add 40-tab support in InAppBrowser.tsx\"}"
      thinking_signature: "\022\301\020\n\276\020\001i\024}\023\236\216\034\226\213\307}j\305\260\331y\216\364\377X\256\"\264\254UI\343\2034\272L\005\n\331!\251}\327\275\2632\026\tGr\250\335\005T\206T\3522\317\341\303\aX?*\027\207\366~\026^\200\353\205.\302Ph\257\223/9C\a,]\255\331\340\t\214\313>^I\256\347W\365\204\320\347G;\247\305\346\220L\001X[=\323W\360\317&S\337\321)\360\365\303-pf\365\203Cq\323\267\272\017]\226B\335\243\200\341\354\bi\327T\2337\327\331\334\320\310\272@\231\002\352\300\022,{\235\325\224\302t\220E<\310\277\036I\216#T\277\035\267UD\236Z\312t\"uF f\304\310\264E\361\'d\376\235\205u\341\307\364\231Mp(F\261\246\026\300\222\204\336\006\361\224\244>\353=\256\327\271\243\374\020Z\t%\b\256R2DT\367\374\327\244\226\363\027\361Q_\005\233\210 \303\312\037\f\254\207\235$R\350H\360\31786\271\031\236~\364\000\020\250\027\325\020\177\'.\265\3000q\"\263D\022Q\021s\025\003[\303g\"\a#\177\177\272\242\030\235\327C\264,\371\353\322\371S\370\205|\333O\262C\266o\0305w\344\020le\006\222\261\204\003\356:\027\340\241\367;\a\235\006\302tc\036\004^\222\325*\310\254|\225bO\263\264h@\360D\340@\262\024>\266\232C\022\256\365\330\366\024\254d\3604\fO\227G\210Y6p\271\005\313-\025FI\331\224H\252\t\354ld$onkix\\Y#`\311\272\234\240|\220\006\220\r\224\336\245\356O[\374\024?\277\027z>`\236\234 F~3\307\\\240u\313\264\261\364\3127\352\224_\262\237\2502S\303\336i-\204\333\266\2209\336V\270Z,\027\250\270Pz\242\247l\223vc\335\255\336\210(\252\346\336v\aA&\243D|:\003\376\203S\205\340s\330\365\364\220\340\313\a\264\320\355F\201Hy\313\365\025?#\213\227\004r6\230\336o\204R\345\367x\356\365\242\321]\361\227\034/\200\2555\0349}kD!\322z\241\\\363l\333GJ\207\244\004,c\255tv*\367\'\253\332\213\321n\225u\251a~{\226\206\211o\330c\023\203\257!\336-)$\250DI\vK\301\031\205M\350=Y<\310\274TZ\b\352g\301\212\373{\245\311P\241\vu\037\312\325\2205<-33xU\322\"\344\274\371B3=0\216\255m\272\332a\320Y7\312\2278\232+\302Fc\235\004\336{\034\367H\227\231\221w8\262\353\277\306\\\227P\331\213\240\2217\336\360h\315\243+x\003\247>M=T:RC\322\221\254N\2757\343\037\356\aT\242\371\30443\003\265\230eAH\315~<&\034\000\323Tn\230\306\001f\222\360A\224\'o\247\027\373\266\216\373\\\244\373^\0269\231>\250yp[\227\350\370,\030\263\277\345\240\2075\215\220!x\260\304~e\223\027$\305\373\034P9\270\224\360\265\361\321\230CI\n\256\2606\251\357_\321\265\216i\022x\022\211EfYHez\034R\377\324\212\r9^>\034\314\305v\3777H\373\307\3539\256\224\020\267\"Sln\241\307\022\v\333\230{\304\034`R\370\006\264\222\220\204x\237\366\177\352\365UI\a@\331\255LL\344\267\372;vl\371\364If\210\353\016\034o\366\227\225\006,\332\345\225\\M\254,\261\"6\242\3572\024T\n\353\220\212u\260\200\025R\311\314\226\337\242\\m\344W\346\004\t\321 \337\032\377pg\202\ns\317\300)\223h \022\244\241)\363E4\035KMC\276R\274\261ZV\2249\343P\263\177\357\033\220\034zszrR\351\311x\b\031!\267\367a\330~FVf\200U\347\314\002\350*\315\363\253Xc[uX\216\006\261?@.\236G\005:j\315\216 :\211+g\0241B\337\213\366b0\310\036\271C&\223\235\034\3700\277\261y\003r\033\202\177\324\346\314\344\032\206\370\346a%cp\253\374\331V\314\026m\301\203\376\n\037^\226\322\226\003\262\365\310\301B\331\251\276\2346G%\217\270\304\234\310\0163\226\33439\224\033\000\331\260\206KT\262\360\002\210\273u4\352\363\n?\001|\205\340\227\027\354\330aN\237\237-B\374\332\t0\217\204\377\255\226 S\360\2436\f\354f\"\b\376\211\334j\376\215\343\322Zn\340V9\221fX\345\001\210\025\253\217\v.\247+\230\001\306\2322 \256\310;\b\027\275\"?\252\250\234k\031\332\245_\370\216\006\336\311\313\177F\321\f\3521(\245\261\224\243N\273\250\312\374s\256\376fWO\027n\214\202 jT\264\375O\0161\320\201,\230C\264\250\fP\351\371gzmML\206%\270\366Fh\211{\001Z\364\201\263\312\2115@^N\241\004\235\262\345\024\303+\265\216(\204I\376di\340\263\277j=\340c\372\034\227\236\340O,\314\235\031d@P\255\200\003\351\312\223\373\247\267\nD\331\017\257\267u\312Wi\260\353zS\"e\271\036\216n\373\214\017\373C\262\361i&\254S\255=6\267\300\221\237\244\337B\027\\\226A-<n\227R\032\221\216s\"BE\244]\317\304JSV\034\032\273\337\032\374\t=\362Nb\024\335T\v&S\265P=\313\vL6\022\304\204g\341\270\232-\244\265[\351.\263`\256\270\314\356\350\006QU\272\361\333\216g\321(t\017-gH\365\223a\234H\322n\347\214b\207\247\026\367H\005\246\266^|v\316:\213rz\217\341\262\253\324b\337\324,\300\004\314\f\000\373\204\217q\241\235\206\033\243}m\260\203\333\017\313\313@U\022\213\345La\215\016B\207\253\332#\005\246\256l\305i\210]M_\271\304g\353i\244\021@\346v\316\307\366\226\336\177\352|]+\241\006\353u%\3311\'y\334\276\005\234\332\027T)d8\363\r\3040 \316\360\001\r\271r\223\323\004L\000\325\247^\203\252\366\232\205x\207n\f\217\257\225?\356\220T\304\257\001&\256\351C\'<NJ\241iN\312\262\320$\225<Y\316\234\265\371{*a{\217\351a\207\243G\343\214\037\020\3752MtC\031`Nk\026\020\240\220\300\036\226\276\357\0305\032\332\027/\335]a\205?Z\352O\363At\334\342\211#\366\362;\201\231+\006!\201\027V\322V\304\340Q\236\203#E\363\334\257\252E\200\"\314\230H\343(\273\263Mc!q\242TV\340\364;\215\003f\245\213\226\262\315\315f\255\333#\002\267<s\vt\016\240\035\307\t\277\207\263)H\217$\263{\004v8t\330IWP\305-\374B\023\254\254\375J\005U1\270\nk/\'\340q\257r:\334v`494\216([HU\232)\240\254\304\353\3070|?\304\344\313j4\264\b/\230$\233\206\225\267\353\207j\0343\301\006\0010\300\31435\351\204L\251p(W\224\302\230\342\232\251\225\00196\361\\\0029\215\222)\220\376\327\322\214$\251\301\225\265H1\351\366\267\220\006o\265\360g\314\n\0316\361\027\265\260\002\352\207\204\351s\365o\226\tW\227\307\353\306\000\v]\033|\230[O\305\215\000\257\376\262\"\267\2555(\253\367\005\035&\340V_\247z\237\363\370\360\217k-\365*M\315\256c\256\212e\26160\327\236m\001Y\242K\214\030\307K\370\334\030\365\037mO\021\3654\374\274\037kT\210\372!p\364\360\037.eZ\025\205\250\277=`WGo\215\375D\234#FlQ\352\376K\223\221\370\nb\314\314$26\317\370\322\350\200(\305/W\032\361\242x\345\336P\202\327?\373\344\020)q\350\265#\366\000]\305%Y\307\204\311oR&\"\000\213\235\213\264\202\353\371 \243\310\315\260\200*v\347\177N>\312\311\207B\314\306\314I(\372L3I\314\037\2470\206\345"
