  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Refining Font Sizing**\n\nI\'ve been working on improving the font sizing in `src/index.css`. Specifically, I\'m implementing a system-adaptive approach for the `html` element. I\'m using `clamp` to define a font size that scales responsively across different screen sizes, with a minimum of 15px and a maximum of 18px. I\'ve also included `-webkit-text-size-adjust` and `text-size-adjust` for cross-browser compatibility.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_144107"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"@import \\\"tailwindcss\\\";\\n\\n@layer base {\\n  html {\\n    /* Adaptive system font scaling: responsive to user preference and viewport width */\\n    font-size: clamp(15px, 0.95rem + 0.25vw, 18px);\\n    -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;\\n    text-size-adjust: 100%;\\n  }\\n\\n  body {\\n    font-family: \'Plus Jakarta Sans\', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;\\n    -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;\\n    touch-action: manipulation;\\n    font-size: 1rem;\\n    line-height: 1.5;\\n  }\\n\\n  code, pre, .font-mono {\\n    font-family: \'JetBrains Mono\', monospace;\\n  }\\n}\\n\\n/* System Adaptive Font Scaling Classes */\\n.font-scale-standard {\\n  font-size: 1rem;\\n}\\n\\n.font-scale-large {\\n  font-size: 1.125rem;\\n}\\n\\n.font-scale-xlarge {\\n  font-size: 1.25rem;\\n}\\n\\n/* Custom smooth scrollbar for video lists */\\n::-webkit-scrollbar {\\n  width: 6px;\\n  height: 6px;\\n}\\n\\n::-webkit-scrollbar-track {\\n  background: transparent;\\n}\\n\\n::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {\\n  background: rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.25);\\n  border-radius: 9999px;\\n}\\n\\n::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover {\\n  background: rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.45);\\n}\\n\\n/* Subtitle shadow and glow styling */\\n.subtitle-text {\\n  text-shadow: 0px 2px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9), 0px -1px 2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8), 2px 0px 2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8), -2px 0px 2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8);\\n}\\n\", \"Description\":\"Make base font size adaptive to system and user viewport with fluid rem scaling\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/index.css\", \"toolAction\":\"Updating index.css\", \"toolSummary\":\"Make font size adaptive in index.css\"}"
