  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Integrating the Components**\n\nI\'m now integrating the Audio and Video Enhancement Studio components. I\'m focusing on connecting `EnhancementsModal`, `EnhancementConfig`, and `DEFAULT_ENHANCEMENTS` within `MXPlayer.tsx`. I\'m going to manage the `enhancements` state here, too.\n\n\n**Refining A/V Enhancements**\n\nI\'ve refined the A/V enhancements logic. I\'ve adjusted the `getFilterStyle` function to incorporate dynamic contrast and saturation scaling based on the decoder type, specifically `HW+`. Also, I\'ve implemented night mode and sharpness presets. I\'ve also identified a dedicated \"A/V Enhancements\" button placement in `MXPlayer.tsx`.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_252081"
