  planner_response {
    response: "### Updates Completed\n\n#### 1. Download Path Picker & Manual Confirmation\n- **No Automatic Downloading**: When initiating a download from the browser or stream sniffer, downloading never starts automatically in the background.\n- **Download Confirmation Notification Sheet**: A prompt modal appears displaying:\n  - Editable **File Name**\n  - **Storage Destination Path** picker with preset locations (`/Internal Storage/Download/PlayThat/`, `/Internal Storage/Movies/`, `/SD Card/PlayThat/Downloads/`, etc.) plus a **Custom Path** text input.\n  - Live preview of the target destination path (`/Storage/.../movie.mp4`).\n  - An explicit **Start Download** button to begin the download with your chosen directory, or **Cancel** to abort.\n\n#### 2. Audio & Video Enhancement Studio in Settings\nAccessible directly from the header toolbar (via the \342\234\250 Sparkles button) and inside the MX Player playback settings menu:\n- **Video Enhancements**:\n  - **Hardware Decoder Modes**: `HW` (native hardware GPU), `HW+` (hardware plus dynamic HDR post-processing), and `SW` (software).\n  - **Visual Profiles**: Natural, Crisp Detail, Vivid Pop, and HDR Simulation.\n  - **Dynamic Contrast & Saturation Sliders**: Calibrate video contrast (80%\342\200\223140%) and vibrance (70%\342\200\223150%).\n  - **Night Comfort Mode**: Warms color spectrum to eliminate blue light strain during bedtime viewing.\n- **Audio Enhancements**:\n  - **Sound Amplification (Boost)**: Boost volume up to **200%** with clipping protection.\n  - **Bass Booster**: Deepens low-frequency rumble.\n  - **Clear Voice**: Sharpens dialogue and speech over background sound FX.\n  - **Spatial Stereo Sound**: Expands stereo soundstage for headphones and mobile speakers.\n  - **Equalizer Presets**: Cinema Hall, Mega Bass, Dialogue Focus, Studio Flat, Rock Live, and Concert Hall.\n  - **Bluetooth Audio Delay Sync**: Offset audio timing from -1000ms to +1000ms to eliminate Bluetooth headphone lag.\n\n#### 3. Adaptive System Font Scaling\n- **Fluid Typography**: Base typography in `index.css` is scaled adaptively with system viewport sizing (`clamp(15px, 0.95rem + 0.25vw, 18px)`).\n- **Font Scale Presets**: Choose between **Standard**, **Large (115%)**, and **Extra Large (125%)** directly in the Enhancement Studio to increase text size across the entire application."
    thinking: "**Verifying Functionality of Features**\n\nI\'m pleased to report that the linting and compilation stages of the applet are complete, with zero errors reported! Now, I\'m focusing on verifying the implementation and proper functioning of the requested features, specifically \"Change path during download notification & no automatic download.\" My work now includes detailed checks.\n\n\n**Implementing Download Management**\n\nNow, I\'m concentrating on the download process. I\'ve confirmed the `DownloadPromptModal` triggers consistently for every download. Crucially, downloads *don\'t* start automatically. Users will be prompted with a dialog to edit the file name and choose their destination path. The download initiates only after \"Start Download\" is clicked, using the user-defined destination.\n\n\n"
