  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing the Settings Screen**\n\nI\'ve just finished thoroughly examining the reference image. The initial assessment confirms it\'s a genuine Android MX Player settings screen. I noted the crucial details: the back arrow, the \"Settings\" title placement, and the clean, dark top bar. I also observed the item list structure. The structure includes icons, bold titles, and subtitles.\n\n\n**Refining the Categorization**\n\nI\'m now refining the categorization based on the available information. I\'ve re-evaluated the General section, considering expansion options like Theme and System Font Scale. For the other items, I\'m proposing specific alternatives to replace the \"Gamecenter ad\" item, to fit the app\'s needs. The remaining options: \"Subtitles\" and \"Security & Private Vault\" are essential customizations for our app.\n\n\n"
