  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Checking Download Options**\n\nI\'ve realized that the `EnhancementConfig` structure already accommodates video, audio, and font scaling enhancements, which is great. Now, I\'m shifting my focus to exploring the current or potential download configuration options to see how they can be managed effectively alongside the existing enhancements.\n\n\n**Analyzing Download Configurations**\n\nI\'m now diving into specific download configurations. I\'ve noted crucial details, such as the default download folder path (`/storage/emulated/0/Download/PlayThat/`), the maximum concurrent download tasks (e.g., `3`), and a \"Turbo Cloud\" multi-threaded download boost option. I\'m also considering a confirmation setting for destination paths before download begins, which defaults to `true`. Finally, I\'m carefully examining the reference image to extract the intended configuration UI flow and features.\n\n\n**Designing Settings Sub-Screens**\n\nI\'m now outlining the structure for the settings screens. I envision clickable items leading to sub-settings; for example, I\'m designing general and video settings. The general screen will allow for app language, mockup frame display, font scaling, theme, history clearing, and auto-scan media. The video screen will offer control over the default decoder, dynamic picture settings, sharpness presets, night mode, and aspect ratio.\n\n\n**Defining Audio/Download Controls**\n\nI\'m now focusing on audio and download settings. For audio, I\'m working on a sub-screen with volume boost options (up to 200%), clear voice, bass boost, 3D stereo, equalizer presets, and Bluetooth audio sync. The download settings will offer custom storage paths, a \"save path confirmation\" toggle, control over concurrent tasks, UC Turbo multi-chunk acceleration, M3U8 to MP4 conversion, and a Wi-Fi-only download option. I\'ve noted subtitles and security screens as well.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_364342"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"Append\":false, \"CodeContent\":\"import React, { useState } from \'react\';\\nimport {\\n  ArrowLeft,\\n  Smartphone,\\n  PlayCircle,\\n  Headphones,\\n  ArrowDownToLine,\\n  Subtitles,\\n  ShieldCheck,\\n  Info,\\n  ChevronRight,\\n  Check,\\n  RotateCcw,\\n  Sliders,\\n  Moon,\\n  Sun,\\n  Tv,\\n  Sparkles,\\n  Zap,\\n  FolderOpen,\\n  Volume2,\\n  HardDrive,\\n  Globe,\\n  Lock,\\n  ExternalLink,\\n  Trash2,\\n} from \'lucide-react\';\\nimport { ActiveTab } from \'../types\';\\nimport { EnhancementConfig } from \'./EnhancementsModal\';\\nimport { FrameMode } from \'./AndroidFrame\';\\n\\nexport interface SettingsViewProps {\\n  onBack: () => void;\\n  isDarkMode: boolean;\\n  onToggleDarkMode: () => void;\\n  frameMode: FrameMode;\\n  onChangeFrameMode: (mode: FrameMode) => void;\\n  enhancementConfig: EnhancementConfig;\\n  onUpdateEnhancements: (config: EnhancementConfig) => void;\\n  onOpenSubtitlesModal: () => void;\\n  onOpenVaultModal: () => void;\\n  onShowToast: (msg: string) => void;\\n}\\n\\ntype SubSection = \'main\' | \'general\' | \'video\' | \'audio\' | \'downloads\' | \'about\';\\n\\nexport function SettingsView({\\n  onBack,\\n  isDarkMode,\\n  onToggleDarkMode,\\n  frameMode,\\n  onChangeFrameMode,\\n  enhancementConfig,\\n  onUpdateEnhancements,\\n  onOpenSubtitlesModal,\\n  onOpenVaultModal,\\n  onShowToast,\\n}: SettingsViewProps) {\\n  const [activeSection, setActiveSection] = useState<SubSection>(\'main\');\\n\\n  // Downloads Settings persistent state\\n  const [downloadPath, setDownloadPath] = useState<string>(() => {\\n    return localStorage.getItem(\'playthat_download_path\') || \'/storage/emulated/0/Download/PlayThat/\';\\n  });\\n  const [maxConcurrentDownloads, setMaxConcurrentDownloads] = useState<number>(() => {\\n    return parseInt(localStorage.getItem(\'playthat_max_downloads\') || \'3\', 10);\\n  });\\n  const [askPathBeforeDownload, setAskPathBeforeDownload] = useState<boolean>(() => {\\n    return localStorage.getItem(\'playthat_ask_path\') !== \'false\';\\n  });\\n  const [turboBoostEnabled, setTurboBoostEnabled] = useState<boolean>(() => {\\n    return localStorage.getItem(\'playthat_turbo_boost\') !== \'false\';\\n  });\\n  const [selectedLanguage, setSelectedLanguage] = useState<string>(\'English (United States)\');\\n  const [autoResumePlayback, setAutoResumePlayback] = useState<boolean>(true);\\n  const [backgroundAudioPlay, setBackgroundAudioPlay] = useState<boolean>(true);\\n\\n  const handleUpdateDownloadPath = (newPath: string) => {\\n    setDownloadPath(newPath);\\n    localStorage.setItem(\'playthat_download_path\', newPath);\\n    onShowToast(`Download path updated to ${newPath}`);\\n  };\\n\\n  const handleToggleAskPath = () => {\\n    const val = !askPathBeforeDownload;\\n    setAskPathBeforeDownload(val);\\n    localStorage.setItem(\'playthat_ask_path\', String(val));\\n    onShowToast(val ? \'Will ask path before downloading\' : \'Auto-save to default path\');\\n  };\\n\\n  const handleToggleTurbo = () => {\\n    const val = !turboBoostEnabled;\\n    setTurboBoostEnabled(val);\\n    localStorage.setItem(\'playthat_turbo_boost\', String(val));\\n    onShowToast(val ? \'Turbo 8x acceleration enabled\' : \'Standard single-stream download\');\\n  };\\n\\n  const handleClearHistory = () => {\\n    localStorage.removeItem(\'playthat_history\');\\n    onShowToast(\'Playback history and temporary cache cleared\');\\n  };\\n\\n  // Section Header Renderer\\n  const renderHeader = (title: string, onBackAction: () => void) => (\\n    <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-3 px-4 py-3 border-b border-slate-800/80 bg-slate-950/90 sticky top-0 z-20 backdrop-blur-md\\\">\\n      <button\\n        onClick={onBackAction}\\n        className=\\\"p-2 -ml-1 text-slate-300 hover:text-white rounded-full hover:bg-slate-800/60 active:scale-95 transition-all\\\"\\n        title=\\\"Go back\\\"\\n        aria-label=\\\"Back\\\"\\n      >\\n        <ArrowLeft className=\\\"w-5 h-5\\\" />\\n      </button>\\n      <h2 className=\\\"text-base font-bold text-white tracking-wide\\\">{title}</h2>\\n    </div>\\n  );\\n\\n  return (\\n    <div className=\\\"flex flex-col h-full bg-[#0a0a0c] text-slate-100 overflow-y-auto select-none\\\">\\n      {/* 1. Main Settings List (Matches Reference Screenshot) */}\\n      {activeSection === \'main\' && (\\n        <div className=\\\"flex flex-col pb-8\\\">\\n          {renderHeader(\'Settings\', onBack)}\\n\\n          <div className=\\\"flex flex-col divide-y divide-slate-800/50\\\">\\n            {/* General */}\\n            <button\\n              onClick={() => setActiveSection(\'general\')}\\n              className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between px-4 py-3.5 hover:bg-slate-900/60 active:bg-slate-900 text-left transition-colors group\\\"\\n            >\\n              <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-4\\\">\\n                <Smartphone className=\\\"w-5 h-5 text-slate-300 group-hover:text-blue-400 transition-colors shrink-0\\\" />\\n                <div className=\\\"flex flex-col\\\">\\n                  <span className=\\\"text-sm font-semibold text-slate-100 group-hover:text-white\\\">General</span>\\n                  <span className=\\\"text-xs text-slate-400\\\">Language, History, System Font Scale</span>\\n                </div>\\n              </div>\\n              <ChevronRight className=\\\"w-5 h-5 text-slate-500 group-hover:text-slate-300 transition-colors shrink-0\\\" />\\n            </button>\\n\\n            {/* Video */}\\n            <button\\n              onClick={() => setActiveSection(\'video\')}\\n              className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between px-4 py-3.5 hover:bg-slate-900/60 active:bg-slate-900 text-left transition-colors group\\\"\\n            >\\n              <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-4\\\">\\n                <PlayCircle className=\\\"w-5 h-5 text-slate-300 group-hover:text-cyan-400 transition-colors shrink-0\\\" />\\n                <div className=\\\"flex flex-col\\\">\\n                  <span className=\\\"text-sm font-semibold text-slate-100 group-hover:text-white\\\">Video</span>\\n                  <span className=\\\"text-xs text-slate-400\\\">\\n                    Pop-up play, HW/HW+ decoder, picture enhancements\\n                  </span>\\n                </div>\\n              </div>\\n              <ChevronRight className=\\\"w-5 h-5 text-slate-500 group-hover:text-slate-300 transition-colors shrink-0\\\" />\\n            </button>\\n\\n            {/* Audio */}\\n            <button\\n              onClick={() => setActiveSection(\'audio\')}\\n              className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between px-4 py-3.5 hover:bg-slate-900/60 active:bg-slate-900 text-left transition-colors group\\\"\\n            >\\n              <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-4\\\">\\n                <Headphones className=\\\"w-5 h-5 text-slate-300 group-hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors shrink-0\\\" />\\n                <div className=\\\"flex flex-col\\\">\\n                  <span className=\\\"text-sm font-semibold text-slate-100 group-hover:text-white\\\">Audio</span>\\n                  <span className=\\\"text-xs text-slate-400\\\">\\n                    Volume boost 200%, clear voice, bass boost, equalizer\\n                  </span>\\n                </div>\\n              </div>\\n              <ChevronRight className=\\\"w-5 h-5 text-slate-500 group-hover:text-slate-300 transition-colors shrink-0\\\" />\\n            </button>\\n\\n            {/* Downloads */}\\n            <button\\n              onClick={() => setActiveSection(\'downloads\')}\\n              className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between px-4 py-3.5 hover:bg-slate-900/60 active:bg-slate-900 text-left transition-colors group\\\"\\n            >\\n              <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-4\\\">\\n                <ArrowDownToLine className=\\\"w-5 h-5 text-slate-300 group-hover:text-amber-400 transition-colors shrink-0\\\" />\\n                <div className=\\\"flex flex-col\\\">\\n                  <span className=\\\"text-sm font-semibold text-slate-100 group-hover:text-white\\\">Downloads</span>\\n                  <span className=\\\"text-xs text-slate-400\\\">Path, max download tasks, UC turbo boost</span>\\n                </div>\\n              </div>\\n              <ChevronRight className=\\\"w-5 h-5 text-slate-500 group-hover:text-slate-300 transition-colors shrink-0\\\" />\\n            </button>\\n\\n            {/* Subtitles */}\\n            <button\\n              onClick={onOpenSubtitlesModal}\\n              className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between px-4 py-3.5 hover:bg-slate-900/60 active:bg-slate-900 text-left transition-colors group\\\"\\n            >\\n              <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-4\\\">\\n                <Subtitles className=\\\"w-5 h-5 text-slate-300 group-hover:text-indigo-400 transition-colors shrink-0\\\" />\\n                <div className=\\\"flex flex-col\\\">\\n                  <span className=\\\"text-sm font-semibold text-slate-100 group-hover:text-white\\\">Subtitles</span>\\n                  <span className=\\\"text-xs text-slate-400\\\">Appearance, font size, background box, sync delay</span>\\n                </div>\\n              </div>\\n              <ChevronRight className=\\\"w-5 h-5 text-slate-500 group-hover:text-slate-300 transition-colors shrink-0\\\" />\\n            </button>\\n\\n            {/* Security & Private Vault */}\\n            <button\\n              onClick={onOpenVaultModal}\\n              className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between px-4 py-3.5 hover:bg-slate-900/60 active:bg-slate-900 text-left transition-colors group\\\"\\n            >\\n              <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-4\\\">\\n                <ShieldCheck className=\\\"w-5 h-5 text-slate-300 group-hover:text-purple-400 transition-colors shrink-0\\\" />\\n                <div className=\\\"flex flex-col\\\">\\n                  <span className=\\\"text-sm font-semibold text-slate-100 group-hover:text-white\\\">\\n                    Security & Private Vault\\n                  </span>\\n                  <span className=\\\"text-xs text-slate-400\\\">\\n                    AES-256-GCM encryption, PIN lock & calculator disguise\\n                  </span>\\n                </div>\\n              </div>\\n              <ChevronRight className=\\\"w-5 h-5 text-slate-500 group-hover:text-slate-300 transition-colors shrink-0\\\" />\\n            </button>\\n\\n            {/* About us */}\\n            <button\\n              onClick={() => setActiveSection(\'about\')}\\n              className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between px-4 py-3.5 hover:bg-slate-900/60 active:bg-slate-900 text-left transition-colors group\\\"\\n            >\\n              <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-4\\\">\\n                <Info className=\\\"w-5 h-5 text-slate-300 group-hover:text-blue-400 transition-colors shrink-0\\\" />\\n                <div className=\\\"flex flex-col\\\">\\n                  <span className=\\\"text-sm font-semibold text-slate-100 group-hover:text-white\\\">About us</span>\\n                  <span className=\\\"text-xs text-slate-400\\\">PlayThat! PRO v2.4, acceleration engine & build info</span>\\n                </div>\\n              </div>\\n              <ChevronRight className=\\\"w-5 h-5 text-slate-500 group-hover:text-slate-300 transition-colors shrink-0\\\" />\\n            </button>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      )}\\n\\n      {/* 2. General Settings Subpage */}\\n      {activeSection === \'general\' && (\\n        <div className=\\\"flex flex-col pb-8\\\">\\n          {renderHeader(\'General\', () => setActiveSection(\'main\'))}\\n\\n          <div className=\\\"p-4 flex flex-col gap-6\\\">\\n            {/* System Adaptive Font Size */}\\n            <div className=\\\"flex flex-col gap-2\\\">\\n              <label className=\\\"text-xs font-bold text-slate-300 uppercase tracking-wider\\\">\\n                System Adaptive Font Size\\n              </label>\\n              <p className=\\\"text-xs text-slate-400\\\">\\n                Scales interface labels and player typography dynamically to match your device preference.\\n              </p>\\n              <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-3 gap-2 mt-1\\\">\\n                {([\'standard\', \'large\', \'xlarge\'] as const).map((scale) => (\\n                  <button\\n                    key={scale}\\n                    onClick={() => {\\n                      onUpdateEnhancements({ ...enhancementConfig, fontScale: scale });\\n                      onShowToast(`Font scale set to ${scale.toUpperCase()}`);\\n                    }}\\n                    className={`py-2 px-3 rounded-xl border text-xs font-semibold flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 transition-all ${\\n                      enhancementConfig.fontScale === scale\\n                        ? \'bg-blue-600/30 border-blue-500 text-blue-300\'\\n                        : \'bg-slate-900 border-slate-800 text-slate-400 hover:border-slate-700\'\\n                    }`}\\n                  >\\n                    {scale === \'standard\' && <span>Standard (100%)</span>}\\n                    {scale === \'large\' && <span>Large (115%)</span>}\\n                    {scale === \'xlarge\' && <span>Extra Large (130%)</span>}\\n                  </button>\\n                ))}\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            {/* Display Mockup Frame */}\\n            <div className=\\\"flex flex-col gap-2 border-t border-slate-800/80 pt-4\\\">\\n              <label className=\\\"text-xs font-bold text-slate-300 uppercase tracking-wider\\\">\\n                Device Layout & Viewport Frame\\n              </label>\\n              <p className=\\\"text-xs text-slate-400\\\">\\n                Switch between full responsive browser view or authentic Android device frames.\\n              </p>\\n              <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-3 gap-2 mt-1\\\">\\n                <button\\n                  onClick={() => {\\n                    onChangeFrameMode(\'phone\');\\n                    onShowToast(\'Phone frame mode active\');\\n                  }}\\n                  className={`py-2 px-3 rounded-xl border text-xs font-semibold flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 transition-all ${\\n                    frameMode === \'phone\'\\n                      ? \'bg-blue-600/30 border-blue-500 text-blue-300\'\\n                      : \'bg-slate-900 border-slate-800 text-slate-400 hover:border-slate-700\'\\n                  }`}\\n                >\\n                  <Smartphone className=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" />\\n                  <span>Phone</span>\\n                </button>\\n                <button\\n                  onClick={() => {\\n                    onChangeFrameMode(\'tablet\');\\n                    onShowToast(\'Tablet frame mode active\');\\n                  }}\\n                  className={`py-2 px-3 rounded-xl border text-xs font-semibold flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 transition-all ${\\n                    frameMode === \'tablet\'\\n                      ? \'bg-blue-600/30 border-blue-500 text-blue-300\'\\n                      : \'bg-slate-900 border-slate-800 text-slate-400 hover:border-slate-700\'\\n                  }`}\\n                >\\n                  <Tv className=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" />\\n                  <span>Tablet</span>\\n                </button>\\n                <button\\n                  onClick={() => {\\n                    onChangeFrameMode(\'none\');\\n                    onShowToast(\'Responsive full view active\');\\n                  }}\\n                  className={`py-2 px-3 rounded-xl border text-xs font-semibold flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 transition-all ${\\n                    frameMode === \'none\'\\n                      ? \'bg-blue-600/30 border-blue-500 text-blue-300\'\\n                      : \'bg-slate-900 border-slate-800 text-slate-400 hover:border-slate-700\'\\n                  }`}\\n                >\\n                  <Zap className=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" />\\n                  <span>Full</span>\\n                </button>\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            {/* App Language */}\\n            <div className=\\\"flex flex-col gap-2 border-t border-slate-800/80 pt-4\\\">\\n              <label className=\\\"text-xs font-bold text-slate-300 uppercase tracking-wider\\\">\\n                Language\\n              </label>\\n              <div className=\\\"bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl overflow-hidden divide-y divide-slate-800/60\\\">\\n                {[\'English (United States)\', \'Espa\303\261ol (Latinoam\303\251rica)\', \'Deutsch (Deutschland)\', \'Fran\303\247ais (France)\', \'\346\227\245\346\234\254\350\252\236 (Japan)\'].map((lang) => (\\n                  <button\\n                    key={lang}\\n                    onClick={() => {\\n                      setSelectedLanguage(lang);\\n                      onShowToast(`Language set to ${lang}`);\\n                    }}\\n                    className=\\\"w-full flex items-center justify-between px-3 py-2.5 text-xs text-left text-slate-300 hover:bg-slate-800/50\\\"\\n                  >\\n                    <span>{lang}</span>\\n                    {selectedLanguage === lang && <Check className=\\\"w-4 h-4 text-blue-400\\\" />}\\n                  </button>\\n                ))}\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            {/* Cache & History */}\\n            <div className=\\\"flex flex-col gap-2 border-t border-slate-800/80 pt-4\\\">\\n              <label className=\\\"text-xs font-bold text-slate-300 uppercase tracking-wider\\\">\\n                History & Storage\\n              </label>\\n              <button\\n                onClick={handleClearHistory}\\n                className=\\\"w-full py-2.5 px-4 rounded-xl bg-red-950/40 border border-red-800/40 text-xs font-semibold text-red-300 hover:bg-red-900/40 flex items-center justify-center gap-2 transition-colors\\\"\\n              >\\n                <Trash2 className=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" />\\n                <span>Clear Playback History & Cache</span>\\n              </button>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      )}\\n\\n      {/* 3. Video Settings Subpage */}\\n      {activeSection === \'video\' && (\\n        <div className=\\\"flex flex-col pb-8\\\">\\n          {renderHeader(\'Video\', () => setActiveSection(\'main\'))}\\n\\n          <div className=\\\"p-4 flex flex-col gap-6\\\">\\n            {/* Decoder Engine */}\\n            <div className=\\\"flex flex-col gap-2\\\">\\n              <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between\\\">\\n                <label className=\\\"text-xs font-bold text-slate-300 uppercase tracking-wider\\\">\\n                  Hardware Decoder Mode\\n                </label>\\n                <span className=\\\"text-[11px] font-mono text-cyan-400\\\">{enhancementConfig.decoder}</span>\\n              </div>\\n              <p className=\\\"text-xs text-slate-400\\\">\\n                HW+ employs direct WebCodecs GPU acceleration with custom rendering filters.\\n              </p>\\n              <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-3 gap-2 mt-1\\\">\\n                {([\'HW+\', \'HW\', \'SW\'] as const).map((mode) => (\\n                  <button\\n                    key={mode}\\n                    onClick={() => {\\n                      onUpdateEnhancements({ ...enhancementConfig, decoder: mode });\\n                      onShowToast(`Decoder switched to ${mode}`);\\n                    }}\\n                    className={`py-2 px-3 rounded-xl border text-xs font-semibold flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 transition-all ${\\n                      enhancementConfig.decoder === mode\\n                        ? \'bg-cyan-600/30 border-cyan-500 text-cyan-300\'\\n                        : \'bg-slate-900 border-slate-800 text-slate-400 hover:border-slate-700\'\\n                    }`}\\n                  >\\n                    <span>{mode}</span>\\n                  </button>\\n                ))}\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            {/* Dynamic Contrast & Saturation */}\\n            <div className=\\\"flex flex-col gap-3 border-t border-slate-800/80 pt-4\\\">\\n              <label className=\\\"text-xs font-bold text-slate-300 uppercase tracking-wider\\\">\\n                Display Picture Adjustments\\n              </label>\\n\\n              <div className=\\\"flex flex-col gap-1.5\\\">\\n                <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between text-xs\\\">\\n                  <span className=\\\"text-slate-400\\\">Dynamic Contrast</span>\\n                  <span className=\\\"font-mono text-cyan-300\\\">{enhancementConfig.contrast}%</span>\\n                </div>\\n                <input\\n                  type=\\\"range\\\"\\n                  min=\\\"80\\\"\\n                  max=\\\"140\\\"\\n                  value={enhancementConfig.contrast}\\n                  onChange={(e) =>\\n                    onUpdateEnhancements({ ...enhancementConfig, contrast: Number(e.target.value) })\\n                  }\\n                  className=\\\"w-full accent-cyan-400 cursor-pointer\\\"\\n                />\\n              </div>\\n\\n              <div className=\\\"flex flex-col gap-1.5\\\">\\n                <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between text-xs\\\">\\n                  <span className=\\\"text-slate-400\\\">Color Saturation</span>\\n                  <span className=\\\"font-mono text-cyan-300\\\">{enhancementConfig.saturation}%</span>\\n                </div>\\n                <input\\n                  type=\\\"range\\\"\\n                  min=\\\"80\\\"\\n                  max=\\\"150\\\"\\n                  value={enhancementConfig.saturation}\\n                  onChange={(e) =>\\n                    onUpdateEnhancements({ ...enhancementConfig, saturation: Number(e.target.value) })\\n                  }\\n                  className=\\\"w-full accent-cyan-400 cursor-pointer\\\"\\n                />\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            {/* Sharpness & Night Mode */}\\n            <div className=\\\"flex flex-col gap-3 border-t border-slate-800/80 pt-4\\\">\\n              <label className=\\\"text-xs font-bold text-slate-300 uppercase tracking-wider\\\">\\n                Video Picture Profile\\n              </label>\\n              <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-2\\\">\\n                {([\'natural\', \'crisp\', \'vivid\', \'hdr_tone\'] as const).map((preset) => (\\n                  <button\\n                    key={preset}\\n                    onClick={() => {\\n                      onUpdateEnhancements({ ...enhancementConfig, sharpnessPreset: preset });\\n                      onShowToast(`Picture preset: ${preset.toUpperCase()}`);\\n                    }}\\n                    className={`py-2 px-3 rounded-xl border text-xs font-semibold capitalize transition-all ${\\n                      enhancementConfig.sharpnessPreset === preset\\n                        ? \'bg-cyan-600/30 border-cyan-500 text-cyan-300\'\\n                        : \'bg-slate-900 border-slate-800 text-slate-400 hover:border-slate-700\'\\n                    }`}\\n                  >\\n                    {preset.replace(\'_\', \' \')}\\n                  </button>\\n                ))}\\n              </div>\\n\\n              {/* Night Comfort Mode */}\\n              <button\\n                onClick={() => {\\n                  const val = !enhancementConfig.nightMode;\\n                  onUpdateEnhancements({ ...enhancementConfig, nightMode: val });\\n                  onShowToast(val ? \'Night comfort warm filter ON\' : \'Night comfort filter OFF\');\\n                }}\\n                className={`flex items-center justify-between p-3 rounded-xl border text-xs font-semibold transition-all ${\\n                  enhancementConfig.nightMode\\n                    ? \'bg-amber-600/20 border-amber-500 text-amber-300\'\\n                    : \'bg-slate-900 border-slate-800 text-slate-300 hover:border-slate-700\'\\n                }`}\\n              >\\n                <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2\\\">\\n                  <Moon className=\\\"w-4 h-4 text-amber-400\\\" />\\n                  <span>Night Comfort Filter (Warm tone)</span>\\n                </div>\\n                <div\\n                  className={`w-9 h-5 rounded-full p-0.5 transition-colors ${\\n                    enhancementConfig.nightMode ? \'bg-amber-500\' : \'bg-slate-700\'\\n                  }`}\\n                >\\n                  <div\\n                    className={`w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-white transition-transform ${\\n                      enhancementConfig.nightMode ? \'translate-x-4\' : \'translate-x-0\'\\n                    }`}\\n                  />\\n                </div>\\n              </button>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            {/* Playback Behaviors */}\\n            <div className=\\\"flex flex-col gap-2 border-t border-slate-800/80 pt-4\\\">\\n              <label className=\\\"text-xs font-bold text-slate-300 uppercase tracking-wider\\\">\\n                Playback Behavior\\n              </label>\\n\\n              <button\\n                onClick={() => {\\n                  setAutoResumePlayback(!autoResumePlayback);\\n                  onShowToast(autoResumePlayback ? \'Auto-resume turned OFF\' : \'Auto-resume turned ON\');\\n                }}\\n                className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between p-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 text-xs text-slate-300\\\"\\n              >\\n                <span>Resume playback from last position</span>\\n                <div\\n                  className={`w-9 h-5 rounded-full p-0.5 transition-colors ${\\n                    autoResumePlayback ? \'bg-cyan-500\' : \'bg-slate-700\'\\n                  }`}\\n                >\\n                  <div\\n                    className={`w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-white transition-transform ${\\n                      autoResumePlayback ? \'translate-x-4\' : \'translate-x-0\'\\n                    }`}\\n                  />\\n                </div>\\n              </button>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      )}\\n\\n      {/* 4. Audio Settings Subpage */}\\n      {activeSection === \'audio\' && (\\n        <div className=\\\"flex flex-col pb-8\\\">\\n          {renderHeader(\'Audio\', () => setActiveSection(\'main\'))}\\n\\n          <div className=\\\"p-4 flex flex-col gap-6\\\">\\n            {/* 200% Volume Boost */}\\n            <div className=\\\"flex flex-col gap-2\\\">\\n              <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between\\\">\\n                <label className=\\\"text-xs font-bold text-slate-300 uppercase tracking-wider\\\">\\n                  MX Volume Boost (Up to 200%)\\n                </label>\\n                <span className=\\\"text-[11px] font-mono text-emerald-400 font-bold\\\">\\n                  {enhancementConfig.volumeBoost}%\\n                </span>\\n              </div>\\n              <p className=\\\"text-xs text-slate-400\\\">\\n                Web Audio gain node boosts playback beyond hardware 100% limit with dynamic limiter.\\n              </p>\\n              <input\\n                type=\\\"range\\\"\\n                min=\\\"100\\\"\\n                max=\\\"200\\\"\\n                step=\\\"5\\\"\\n                value={enhancementConfig.volumeBoost}\\n                onChange={(e) =>\\n                  onUpdateEnhancements({ ...enhancementConfig, volumeBoost: Number(e.target.value) })\\n                }\\n                className=\\\"w-full accent-emerald-500 cursor-pointer mt-1\\\"\\n              />\\n            </div>\\n\\n            {/* Vocal Clarity, Bass Boost, Spatial Stereo */}\\n            <div className=\\\"flex flex-col gap-2 border-t border-slate-800/80 pt-4\\\">\\n              <label className=\\\"text-xs font-bold text-slate-300 uppercase tracking-wider\\\">\\n                Sound Enhancers\\n              </label>\\n\\n              <button\\n                onClick={() => {\\n                  const val = !enhancementConfig.vocalClarity;\\n                  onUpdateEnhancements({ ...enhancementConfig, vocalClarity: val });\\n                  onShowToast(val ? \'Clear voice vocal clarity ON\' : \'Clear voice vocal clarity OFF\');\\n                }}\\n                className={`flex items-center justify-between p-3 rounded-xl border text-xs font-semibold transition-all ${\\n                  enhancementConfig.vocalClarity\\n                    ? \'bg-emerald-600/20 border-emerald-500 text-emerald-300\'\\n                    : \'bg-slate-900 border-slate-800 text-slate-300\'\\n                }`}\\n              >\\n                <span>Clear Voice (Speech Enhancer)</span>\\n                <div\\n                  className={`w-9 h-5 rounded-full p-0.5 transition-colors ${\\n                    enhancementConfig.vocalClarity ? \'bg-emerald-500\' : \'bg-slate-700\'\\n                  }`}\\n                >\\n                  <div\\n                    className={`w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-white transition-transform ${\\n                      enhancementConfig.vocalClarity ? \'translate-x-4\' : \'translate-x-0\'\\n                    }`}\\n                  />\\n                </div>\\n              </button>\\n\\n              <button\\n                onClick={() => {\\n                  const val = !enhancementConfig.bassBoost;\\n                  onUpdateEnhancements({ ...enhancementConfig, bassBoost: val });\\n                  onShowToast(val ? \'Deep bass boost ON\' : \'Deep bass boost OFF\');\\n                }}\\n                className={`flex items-center justify-between p-3 rounded-xl border text-xs font-semibold transition-all ${\\n                  enhancementConfig.bassBoost\\n                    ? \'bg-emerald-600/20 border-emerald-500 text-emerald-300\'\\n                    : \'bg-slate-900 border-slate-800 text-slate-300\'\\n                }`}\\n              >\\n                <span>Deep Bass Boost</span>\\n                <div\\n                  className={`w-9 h-5 rounded-full p-0.5 transition-colors ${\\n                    enhancementConfig.bassBoost ? \'bg-emerald-500\' : \'bg-slate-700\'\\n                  }`}\\n                >\\n                  <div\\n                    className={`w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-white transition-transform ${\\n                      enhancementConfig.bassBoost ? \'translate-x-4\' : \'translate-x-0\'\\n                    }`}\\n                  />\\n                </div>\\n              </button>\\n\\n              <button\\n                onClick={() => {\\n                  const val = !enhancementConfig.spatialStereo;\\n                  onUpdateEnhancements({ ...enhancementConfig, spatialStereo: val });\\n                  onShowToast(val ? \'3D Spatial stereo ON\' : \'3D Spatial stereo OFF\');\\n                }}\\n                className={`flex items-center justify-between p-3 rounded-xl border text-xs font-semibold transition-all ${\\n                  enhancementConfig.spatialStereo\\n                    ? \'bg-emerald-600/20 border-emerald-500 text-emerald-300\'\\n                    : \'bg-slate-900 border-slate-800 text-slate-300\'\\n                }`}\\n              >\\n                <span>3D Spatial Stereo</span>\\n                <div\\n                  className={`w-9 h-5 rounded-full p-0.5 transition-colors ${\\n                    enhancementConfig.spatialStereo ? \'bg-emerald-500\' : \'bg-slate-700\'\\n                  }`}\\n                >\\n                  <div\\n                    className={`w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-white transition-transform ${\\n                      enhancementConfig.spatialStereo ? \'translate-x-4\' : \'translate-x-0\'\\n                    }`}\\n                  />\\n                </div>\\n              </button>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            {/* Equalizer Presets */}\\n            <div className=\\\"flex flex-col gap-2 border-t border-slate-800/80 pt-4\\\">\\n              <label className=\\\"text-xs font-bold text-slate-300 uppercase tracking-wider\\\">\\n                Equalizer Preset\\n              </label>\\n              <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-3 gap-2\\\">\\n                {([\'movie\', \'dialogue\', \'bass\', \'rock\', \'concert\', \'flat\'] as const).map((preset) => (\\n                  <button\\n                    key={preset}\\n                    onClick={() => {\\n                      onUpdateEnhancements({ ...enhancementConfig, equalizerPreset: preset });\\n                      onShowToast(`Equalizer: ${preset.toUpperCase()}`);\\n                    }}\\n                    className={`py-2 px-2 rounded-xl border text-xs font-semibold capitalize transition-all ${\\n                      enhancementConfig.equalizerPreset === preset\\n                        ? \'bg-emerald-600/30 border-emerald-500 text-emerald-300\'\\n                        : \'bg-slate-900 border-slate-800 text-slate-400 hover:border-slate-700\'\\n                    }`}\\n                  >\\n                    {preset}\\n                  </button>\\n                ))}\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            {/* Background Play */}\\n            <div className=\\\"flex flex-col gap-2 border-t border-slate-800/80 pt-4\\\">\\n              <label className=\\\"text-xs font-bold text-slate-300 uppercase tracking-wider\\\">\\n                Background Playback\\n              </label>\\n              <button\\n                onClick={() => {\\n                  setBackgroundAudioPlay(!backgroundAudioPlay);\\n                  onShowToast(backgroundAudioPlay ? \'Background play OFF\' : \'Background play ON\');\\n                }}\\n                className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between p-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 text-xs text-slate-300\\\"\\n              >\\n                <span>Continue audio when app is minimized</span>\\n                <div\\n                  className={`w-9 h-5 rounded-full p-0.5 transition-colors ${\\n                    backgroundAudioPlay ? \'bg-emerald-500\' : \'bg-slate-700\'\\n                  }`}\\n                >\\n                  <div\\n                    className={`w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-white transition-transform ${\\n                      backgroundAudioPlay ? \'translate-x-4\' : \'translate-x-0\'\\n                    }`}\\n                  />\\n                </div>\\n              </button>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      )}\\n\\n      {/* 5. Downloads Settings Subpage */}\\n      {activeSection === \'downloads\' && (\\n        <div className=\\\"flex flex-col pb-8\\\">\\n          {renderHeader(\'Downloads\', () => setActiveSection(\'main\'))}\\n\\n          <div className=\\\"p-4 flex flex-col gap-6\\\">\\n            {/* Storage Path */}\\n            <div className=\\\"flex flex-col gap-2\\\">\\n              <label className=\\\"text-xs font-bold text-slate-300 uppercase tracking-wider\\\">\\n                Storage Path\\n              </label>\\n              <p className=\\\"text-xs text-slate-400\\\">\\n                Default Android storage directory where videos and M3U8 converted streams are saved.\\n              </p>\\n              <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2 mt-1\\\">\\n                <input\\n                  type=\\\"text\\\"\\n                  value={downloadPath}\\n                  onChange={(e) => setDownloadPath(e.target.value)}\\n                  className=\\\"flex-1 px-3 py-2 bg-slate-900 border border-slate-700 rounded-xl text-xs font-mono text-amber-300 focus:outline-none focus:border-amber-400\\\"\\n                />\\n                <button\\n                  onClick={() => handleUpdateDownloadPath(downloadPath)}\\n                  className=\\\"px-3 py-2 bg-amber-600 hover:bg-amber-500 rounded-xl text-xs font-semibold text-white transition-colors\\\"\\n                >\\n                  Save\\n                </button>\\n              </div>\\n\\n              {/* Quick Preset Folders */}\\n              <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2 mt-1 flex-wrap\\\">\\n                <button\\n                  onClick={() => handleUpdateDownloadPath(\'/storage/emulated/0/Download/PlayThat/\')}\\n                  className=\\\"text-[11px] text-slate-400 hover:text-amber-300 bg-slate-900 px-2 py-1 rounded-md border border-slate-800 font-mono\\\"\\n                >\\n                  Download/PlayThat/\\n                </button>\\n                <button\\n                  onClick={() => handleUpdateDownloadPath(\'/storage/emulated/0/Movies/PlayThat/\')}\\n                  className=\\\"text-[11px] text-slate-400 hover:text-amber-300 bg-slate-900 px-2 py-1 rounded-md border border-slate-800 font-mono\\\"\\n                >\\n                  Movies/PlayThat/\\n                </button>\\n                <button\\n                  onClick={() => handleUpdateDownloadPath(\'/storage/emulated/0/DCIM/PlayThat/\')}\\n                  className=\\\"text-[11px] text-slate-400 hover:text-amber-300 bg-slate-900 px-2 py-1 rounded-md border border-slate-800 font-mono\\\"\\n                >\\n                  DCIM/PlayThat/\\n                </button>\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            {/* Prompt Path Before Starting */}\\n            <div className=\\\"flex flex-col gap-2 border-t border-slate-800/80 pt-4\\\">\\n              <label className=\\\"text-xs font-bold text-slate-300 uppercase tracking-wider\\\">\\n                Download Confirmation Rule\\n              </label>\\n              <button\\n                onClick={handleToggleAskPath}\\n                className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between p-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 text-xs text-slate-300 hover:border-slate-700 transition-colors\\\"\\n              >\\n                <div className=\\\"flex flex-col text-left pr-2\\\">\\n                  <span className=\\\"font-semibold text-white\\\">Ask path before downloading starts</span>\\n                  <span className=\\\"text-[11px] text-slate-400\\\">\\n                    Never auto-start; present dialog to customize filename and path.\\n                  </span>\\n                </div>\\n                <div\\n                  className={`w-9 h-5 rounded-full p-0.5 transition-colors shrink-0 ${\\n                    askPathBeforeDownload ? \'bg-amber-500\' : \'bg-slate-700\'\\n                  }`}\\n                >\\n                  <div\\n                    className={`w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-white transition-transform ${\\n                      askPathBeforeDownload ? \'translate-x-4\' : \'translate-x-0\'\\n                    }`}\\n                  />\\n                </div>\\n              </button>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            {/* UC Turbo Multi-threaded Boost */}\\n            <div className=\\\"flex flex-col gap-2 border-t border-slate-800/80 pt-4\\\">\\n              <label className=\\\"text-xs font-bold text-slate-300 uppercase tracking-wider\\\">\\n                Acceleration Engine\\n              </label>\\n              <button\\n                onClick={handleToggleTurbo}\\n                className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between p-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 text-xs text-slate-300 hover:border-slate-700 transition-colors\\\"\\n              >\\n                <div className=\\\"flex flex-col text-left pr-2\\\">\\n                  <span className=\\\"font-semibold text-white\\\">UC Turbo 8-Chunk Boost</span>\\n                  <span className=\\\"text-[11px] text-slate-400\\\">\\n                    Splits MP4 and M3U8 downloads into parallel range threads.\\n                  </span>\\n                </div>\\n                <div\\n                  className={`w-9 h-5 rounded-full p-0.5 transition-colors shrink-0 ${\\n                    turboBoostEnabled ? \'bg-amber-500\' : \'bg-slate-700\'\\n                  }`}\\n                >\\n                  <div\\n                    className={`w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-white transition-transform ${\\n                      turboBoostEnabled ? \'translate-x-4\' : \'translate-x-0\'\\n                    }`}\\n                  />\\n                </div>\\n              </button>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            {/* Max Concurrent Tasks */}\\n            <div className=\\\"flex flex-col gap-2 border-t border-slate-800/80 pt-4\\\">\\n              <label className=\\\"text-xs font-bold text-slate-300 uppercase tracking-wider\\\">\\n                Max Concurrent Tasks\\n              </label>\\n              <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-4 gap-2\\\">\\n                {[1, 2, 3, 5].map((count) => (\\n                  <button\\n                    key={count}\\n                    onClick={() => {\\n                      setMaxConcurrentDownloads(count);\\n                      localStorage.setItem(\'playthat_max_downloads\', String(count));\\n                      onShowToast(`Max download tasks set to ${count}`);\\n                    }}\\n                    className={`py-2 px-3 rounded-xl border text-xs font-semibold flex items-center justify-center gap-1 transition-all ${\\n                      maxConcurrentDownloads === count\\n                        ? \'bg-amber-600/30 border-amber-500 text-amber-300\'\\n                        : \'bg-slate-900 border-slate-800 text-slate-400 hover:border-slate-700\'\\n                    }`}\\n                  >\\n                    <span>{count} Tasks</span>\\n                  </button>\\n                ))}\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      )}\\n\\n      {/* 6. About Us Subpage */}\\n      {activeSection === \'about\' && (\\n        <div className=\\\"flex flex-col pb-8\\\">\\n          {renderHeader(\'About us\', () => setActiveSection(\'main\'))}\\n\\n          <div className=\\\"p-4 flex flex-col gap-6\\\">\\n            <div className=\\\"flex flex-col items-center justify-center py-6 text-center\\\">\\n              <div className=\\\"w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-tr from-blue-600 to-cyan-500 flex items-center justify-center shadow-xl mb-3\\\">\\n                <PlayCircle className=\\\"w-10 h-10 text-white fill-white/20\\\" />\\n              </div>\\n              <h3 className=\\\"text-lg font-bold text-white tracking-wide\\\">PlayThat! PRO</h3>\\n              <p className=\\\"text-xs text-slate-400 mt-1\\\">Version 2.4 (Build 2026.10 PRO Edition)</p>\\n              <div className=\\\"mt-2 inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-emerald-950/60 border border-emerald-800/50 text-emerald-400 text-[11px] font-semibold\\\">\\n                <Check className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5\\\" />\\n                <span>Hardware Acceleration Active</span>\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            <div className=\\\"flex flex-col divide-y divide-slate-800/60 bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden\\\">\\n              <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between p-3.5 text-xs\\\">\\n                <span className=\\\"text-slate-400\\\">Video Engine</span>\\n                <span className=\\\"font-mono text-slate-200\\\">HLS.js v1.5 + WebCodecs HW+</span>\\n              </div>\\n              <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between p-3.5 text-xs\\\">\\n                <span className=\\\"text-slate-400\\\">Audio DSP</span>\\n                <span className=\\\"font-mono text-slate-200\\\">Web Audio API 200% Gain + DynamicsLimiter</span>\\n              </div>\\n              <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between p-3.5 text-xs\\\">\\n                <span className=\\\"text-slate-400\\\">Downloader</span>\\n                <span className=\\\"font-mono text-slate-200\\\">UC Turbo 8-Chunk Range Fetcher</span>\\n              </div>\\n              <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between p-3.5 text-xs\\\">\\n                <span className=\\\"text-slate-400\\\">Cryptographic Vault</span>\\n                <span className=\\\"font-mono text-slate-200\\\">WebCrypto AES-256-GCM / PBKDF2</span>\\n              </div>\\n              <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between p-3.5 text-xs\\\">\\n                <span className=\\\"text-slate-400\\\">Tab Capacity</span>\\n                <span className=\\\"font-mono text-slate-200\\\">Up to 40 Multi-Tabs</span>\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            <div className=\\\"flex flex-col gap-2\\\">\\n              <span className=\\\"text-xs font-bold text-slate-300 uppercase tracking-wider\\\">\\n                Community & Links\\n              </span>\\n              <a\\n                href=\\\"#github\\\"\\n                onClick={(e) => {\\n                  e.preventDefault();\\n                  onShowToast(\'PlayThat! Open Source Community Project\');\\n                }}\\n                className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between p-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 text-xs text-slate-300 hover:text-white transition-colors\\\"\\n              >\\n                <span>Fans group, official website, pages & channel</span>\\n                <ExternalLink className=\\\"w-4 h-4 text-slate-500\\\" />\\n              </a>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      )}\\n    </div>\\n  );\\n}\\n\", \"Description\":\"Implement authentic Android MX Player Settings screen with sub-settings and integrations\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/components/SettingsView.tsx\", \"toolAction\":\"Creating SettingsView component\", \"toolSummary\":\"Create SettingsView component\"}"
