  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Implementing Media Filters**\n\nI\'m currently working on incorporating the media type filter buttons into the interface. I\'m considering placing them either right above or within the folder scroller for optimal visibility and ease of use. I\'m using the media type filter buttons (`All`, `Videos`, `Music`). My approach involves integrating these buttons to allow users to refine their folder browsing experience.\n\n\n**Refining Filter Button Logic**\n\nI\'ve just finished the visual implementation of the media filter buttons, focusing on their appearance.  I\'ve added visual cues indicating selection. Each button has different states for selected and unselected, and I\'ve implemented the `All`, `Videos`, and `Audio` buttons.  They all change appropriately on selection. Next, I plan to integrate the filter functionality.\n\n\n"
