  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Identifying App Components**\n\nI\'m currently identifying the necessary components for `App.tsx`. I\'ve determined it requires `SettingsView`, `audioPlayerService` and `AudioPlayerState`, `MiniMusicPlayer`, and `MusicPlayerModal` from various locations. I\'m focusing on ensuring I don\'t overlook any crucial elements for the main application structure.\n\n\n**Analyzing Service Integration**\n\nI\'m now focusing on how `audioPlayerService` interacts within `App.tsx`. I\'ve examined its state management using `useState` and `useEffect`, including the subscription mechanism. Also, the `handlePlayMedia` function\'s role in initiating audio playback and the conditional logic to check if a media item is audio or video is fresh in my mind.\n\n\n**Defining Bottom Navigation**\n\nI\'m now focusing on the bottom navigation structure and its components. I need to implement a 5-tab grid layout with specific icons for Media, Browser, Downloads, Playlists, and Settings. I must ensure the active state styling uses monochrome colors. Also, the `MiniMusicPlayer` will be rendered above, conditional on a current track and no full video is playing, while the `MusicPlayerModal` will be activated by the `MiniMusicPlayer`.\n\n\n"
