  planner_response {
    response: "The implementation and integration are complete and verified:\n\n### Summary of Completed Features\n\n1. **Dedicated Settings Tab (Placed strictly after Playlists)**:\n   - Ordered: **`Media` \342\206\222 `Browser` \342\206\222 `Downloads` \342\206\222 `Playlists` \342\206\222 `Settings`**.\n   - Built to match the MX Player settings layout (General, Video, Audio, Downloads, Subtitles, Security & Private Vault, About us) while strictly omitting Game Center and Subscription.\n   - Interactive sub-screens for Audio & Video Enhancements, Subtitle Styling, System Font Sizing, and Vault PIN Security.\n\n2. **Music & Audio Player with Background Playback**:\n   - **Background Audio Engine (`audioPlayerService.ts`)**: Supports audio files (`.mp3`, `.wav`, etc.) playing continuously across tabs (`Media`, `Browser`, `Downloads`, `Playlists`, `Settings`), even during downloads and web browsing.\n   - **Notification Shade Media Controls**: Real OS `navigator.mediaSession` integration (supporting OS lock screens & notification centers) paired with a pull-down **Android Notification Shade** in the UI featuring full playback controls (Play/Pause, Next/Previous, Progress bar).\n   - **Lock Screen Playback & Widget**: Functional simulated Android Lock Screen (with lock toggle) allowing music to continue playing while presenting a lock screen media player widget with real-time scrub bar and controls.\n   - **Docked Mini Music Player & Full Modal**: Persistent docked mini player above the bottom navigation bar and full-screen player with soundwave visualizer, 200% super volume boost, and track queues.\n\n3. **Strict Black, White, and Grey Palette**:\n   - Unified monochrome color system across all UI elements, icons, modals, browser tabs, download bars, and typography (`#000000` pitch black, `#09090b` / `#18181b` dark zinc cards, pure `#ffffff` text, and subtle neutral grey accents).\n\n4. **UC-Style Download Manager (\"PlayThat! Download Manager\")**:\n   - Custom download path configuration prompt before downloads start.\n   - Up to 40 multi-tab support with full-width search bar in the browser."
    modified_response: "The implementation and integration are complete and verified:\n\n### Summary of Completed Features\n\n1. **Dedicated Settings Tab (Placed strictly after Playlists)**:\n   - Ordered: **`Media` \342\206\222 `Browser` \342\206\222 `Downloads` \342\206\222 `Playlists` \342\206\222 `Settings`**.\n   - Built to match the MX Player settings layout (General, Video, Audio, Downloads, Subtitles, Security & Private Vault, About us) while strictly omitting Game Center and Subscription.\n   - Interactive sub-screens for Audio & Video Enhancements, Subtitle Styling, System Font Sizing, and Vault PIN Security.\n\n2. **Music & Audio Player with Background Playback**:\n   - **Background Audio Engine (`audioPlayerService.ts`)**: Supports audio files (`.mp3`, `.wav`, etc.) playing continuously across tabs (`Media`, `Browser`, `Downloads`, `Playlists`, `Settings`), even during downloads and web browsing.\n   - **Notification Shade Media Controls**: Real OS `navigator.mediaSession` integration (supporting OS lock screens & notification centers) paired with a pull-down **Android Notification Shade** in the UI featuring full playback controls (Play/Pause, Next/Previous, Progress bar).\n   - **Lock Screen Playback & Widget**: Functional simulated Android Lock Screen (with lock toggle) allowing music to continue playing while presenting a lock screen media player widget with real-time scrub bar and controls.\n   - **Docked Mini Music Player & Full Modal**: Persistent docked mini player above the bottom navigation bar and full-screen player with soundwave visualizer, 200% super volume boost, and track queues.\n\n3. **Strict Black, White, and Grey Palette**:\n   - Unified monochrome color system across all UI elements, icons, modals, browser tabs, download bars, and typography (`#000000` pitch black, `#09090b` / `#18181b` dark zinc cards, pure `#ffffff` text, and subtle neutral grey accents).\n\n4. **UC-Style Download Manager (\"PlayThat! Download Manager\")**:\n   - Custom download path configuration prompt before downloads start.\n   - Up to 40 multi-tab support with full-width search bar in the browser."
