    thinking: "**Refining Modal Logic**\n\nI\'ve made a key optimization in `src/components/PrivateVaultModal.tsx`. I\'ve added a conditional render: `if (!isOpen) return null;`. Now, when the modal is closed (`isOpen` is false), the component unmounts, boosting performance. I\'ve also begun crafting `handleCloseModal`.\n\n\n"
