  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Refining Visual Presentation**\n\nOkay, I\'ve started tackling the visual tweaks for the music player. I\'ve removed the grayscale filter from both the queue items and the main artwork as requested. The equalizer overlay is now sporting the orange-500 bars, replacing the white background for better visual impact. I\'ve also formatted the document for readability.\n\n\n"
