    thinking: "**Analyzing the Clip**\n\nI\'ve been examining lines 350-398. I see that `overflow-hidden` at line 277 is clipping positioned elements. Then, the `bottom-full mb-1` on line 364 is positioning the dropdown *above* the three-dots button. This setup means the dropdown extends directly into the thumbnail, where the card\'s `overflow-hidden` property cuts it off.\n\n\n**Refining the Menu Behavior**\n\nI\'ve realized the user\'s report directly describes the clipping caused by `overflow-hidden`. Removing it from line 277 resolves the menu\'s top being sliced off. Furthermore, the List View lacked a three-dots button entirely. I\'m focusing on a comprehensive fix: removing `overflow-hidden` from the card container, ensuring the thumbnail has it, and creating a mobile-friendly Action Bottom Sheet/Modal. Clicking outside should also close it.\n\n\n"
