  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Considering Right Zone Actions**\n\nI\'m currently focused on the right zone actions within `src/App.tsx`. I see we\'ve got the Download badge, Enhancements modal, and Vault trigger nailed down. I\'m also thinking about adding an Install or Phone icon, maybe a button. I\'m leaning toward the \"Smartphone\" or \"Download\" icon.\n\n\n**Planning Install Functionality**\n\nI\'m now shifting gears to the install trigger. I\'m exploring an \"Install on Phone\" modal activated by a new WA install trigger, and thinking it\'s best to add \"Install App on Phone\" directly in `SettingsView.tsx` too. I\'ve got the install steps mapped out, and am now going to fix the three-dots clipping issue in `FileBrowser.tsx`.\n\n\n**Designing Action Icons**\n\nI\'m now designing action icons within the file action sheet. I\'m visualizing \"Add to Favorites\" with a heart, \"Move to Private Vault\" with a lock, \"Delete File\" with a trash icon (red accent!), and \"Cancel/Close\" with a grey border. A clean backdrop/button click closes the sheet. This new architecture ensures no clipping.\n\n\n**Implementing PWA Configuration**\n\nI\'m now implementing PWA configuration using VitePWA. I\'ve set `registerType` to \'autoUpdate\' and configured the manifest with the correct names and colors, plus the necessary icon sizes. I\'m also including `devOptions` for module type and considering adding an icon generator for static assets. I\'ll add \"Install on Phone\" to the top bar header and settings view.\n\n\n"
