    thinking: "**Refining Component State**\n\nI\'m currently working on `src/components/FileBrowser.tsx`. I\'ve decided to replace the `activeMenuId` state with `selectedActionMedia: MediaItem | null`. Clicking the three dots on a Grid card or List item will set `setSelectedActionMedia(item)`. I have also removed the redundant code.\n\n\n"
