  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Investigating SVG Conversion**\n\nI\'m currently looking into the `rsvg-convert` delegate failing for Imagemagick when reading SVGs. My plan is to see if I can generate valid PNGs using a small Node script. I\'m thinking of using `zlib` or a pure Node PNG writer. It looks like writing a valid PNG in pure Node.js is about 35 lines; it needs an 8-byte signature and the I...\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_492772"
      name: "run_command"
      arguments_json: "{\"CommandLine\":\"node -e \\\"\\nconst fs = require(\'fs\');\\nconst zlib = require(\'zlib\');\\n\\nfunction crc32(buf) {\\n  let table = new Uint32Array(256);\\n  for (let i = 0; i < 256; i++) {\\n    let c = i;\\n    for (let k = 0; k < 8; k++) c = ((c & 1) ? (0xEDB88320 ^ (c >>> 1)) : (c >>> 1));\\n    table[i] = c;\\n  }\\n  let crc = 0 ^ (-1);\\n  for (let i = 0; i < buf.length; i++) {\\n    crc = (crc >>> 8) ^ table[(crc ^ buf[i]) & 0xFF];\\n  }\\n  return (crc ^ (-1)) >>> 0;\\n}\\n\\nfunction makeChunk(type, data) {\\n  const len = Buffer.alloc(4);\\n  len.writeUInt32BE(data.length, 0);\\n  const typeBuf = Buffer.from(type, \'ascii\');\\n  const crcBuf = Buffer.alloc(4);\\n  const crcVal = crc32(Buffer.concat([typeBuf, data]));\\n  crcBuf.writeUInt32BE(crcVal, 0);\\n  return Buffer.concat([len, typeBuf, data, crcBuf]);\\n}\\n\\nfunction createPng(width, height, drawFn) {\\n  const sig = Buffer.from([137, 80, 78, 71, 13, 10, 26, 10]);\\n  const ihdr = Buffer.alloc(13);\\n  ihdr.writeUInt32BE(width, 0);\\n  ihdr.writeUInt32BE(height, 4);\\n  ihdr.writeUInt8(8, 8); // 8 bits per sample\\n  ihdr.writeUInt8(6, 9); // RGBA\\n  ihdr.writeUInt8(0, 10);\\n  ihdr.writeUInt8(0, 11);\\n  ihdr.writeUInt8(0, 12);\\n  const ihdrChunk = makeChunk(\'IHDR\', ihdr);\\n\\n  const rowSize = 1 + width * 4;\\n  const rawData = Buffer.alloc(rowSize * height);\\n\\n  for (let y = 0; y < height; y++) {\\n    const rowOffset = y * rowSize;\\n    rawData[rowOffset] = 0; // filter None\\n    for (let x = 0; x < width; x++) {\\n      const pxOffset = rowOffset + 1 + x * 4;\\n      const [r, g, b, a] = drawFn(x, y, width, height);\\n      rawData[pxOffset] = r;\\n      rawData[pxOffset + 1] = g;\\n      rawData[pxOffset + 2] = b;\\n      rawData[pxOffset + 3] = a;\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  const compressed = zlib.deflateSync(rawData);\\n  const idatChunk = makeChunk(\'IDAT\', compressed);\\n  const iendChunk = makeChunk(\'IEND\', Buffer.alloc(0));\\n  return Buffer.concat([sig, ihdrChunk, idatChunk, iendChunk]);\\n}\\n\\n// Generate PlayThat! app icon\\nfunction drawIcon(x, y, w, h) {\\n  // Normalize\\n  const nx = x / w;\\n  const ny = y / h;\\n  const cx = 0.5, cy = 0.5;\\n  const dist = Math.sqrt((nx - cx) ** 2 + (ny - cy) ** 2);\\n\\n  // Background rounded squircle / circle\\n  if (dist > 0.48) return [0, 0, 0, 0]; // outside\\n  \\n  // Outer border & chassis\\n  if (dist > 0.44) return [39, 39, 42, 255]; // zinc-800\\n  if (dist > 0.41) return [24, 24, 27, 255]; // zinc-900\\n\\n  // Play triangle check\\n  // Vertex 1: (0.40, 0.32), Vertex 2: (0.70, 0.50), Vertex 3: (0.40, 0.68)\\n  const x1 = 0.40, y1 = 0.30, x2 = 0.72, y2 = 0.50, x3 = 0.40, y3 = 0.70;\\n  function sign(px, py, ax, ay, bx, by) {\\n    return (px - bx) * (ay - by) - (ax - bx) * (py - by);\\n  }\\n  const d1 = sign(nx, ny, x1, y1, x2, y2);\\n  const d2 = sign(nx, ny, x2, y2, x3, y3);\\n  const d3 = sign(nx, ny, x3, y3, x1, y1);\\n  const hasNeg = (d1 < 0) || (d2 < 0) || (d3 < 0);\\n  const hasPos = (d1 > 0) || (d2 > 0) || (d3 > 0);\\n  const inTriangle = !(hasNeg && hasPos);\\n\\n  if (inTriangle) {\\n    // Orange gradient Play button\\n    const grad = (nx - 0.4) / 0.32;\\n    const r = Math.min(255, Math.floor(251 - grad * 15));\\n    const g = Math.min(255, Math.floor(146 - grad * 50));\\n    const b = Math.min(255, Math.floor(60 - grad * 45));\\n    return [r, g, b, 255];\\n  }\\n\\n  // Radar ring\\n  if (Math.abs(dist - 0.35) < 0.008) return [249, 115, 22, 160]; // subtle orange ring\\n  if (Math.abs(dist - 0.26) < 0.006) return [82, 82, 91, 200]; // subtle grey ring\\n\\n  // Dark body\\n  return [9, 9, 11, 255]; // zinc-950\\n}\\n\\nfunction drawMaskable(x, y, w, h) {\\n  const nx = x / w;\\n  const ny = y / h;\\n  const x1 = 0.42, y1 = 0.35, x2 = 0.68, y2 = 0.50, x3 = 0.42, y3 = 0.65;\\n  function sign(px, py, ax, ay, bx, by) {\\n    return (px - bx) * (ay - by) - (ax - bx) * (py - by);\\n  }\\n  const d1 = sign(nx, ny, x1, y1, x2, y2);\\n  const d2 = sign(nx, ny, x2, y2, x3, y3);\\n  const d3 = sign(nx, ny, x3, y3, x1, y1);\\n  const inTriangle = !(((d1 < 0) || (d2 < 0) || (d3 < 0)) && ((d1 > 0) || (d2 > 0) || (d3 > 0)));\\n\\n  if (inTriangle) return [249, 115, 22, 255]; // orange\\n\\n  const dist = Math.sqrt((nx - 0.5) ** 2 + (ny - 0.5) ** 2);\\n  if (Math.abs(dist - 0.32) < 0.01) return [63, 63, 70, 255];\\n\\n  return [9, 9, 11, 255];\\n}\\n\\nfs.writeFileSync(\'public/pwa-192x192.png\', createPng(192, 192, drawIcon));\\nfs.writeFileSync(\'public/pwa-512x512.png\', createPng(512, 512, drawIcon));\\nfs.writeFileSync(\'public/apple-touch-icon.png\', createPng(180, 180, drawIcon));\\nfs.writeFileSync(\'public/pwa-maskable-512x512.png\', createPng(512, 512, drawMaskable));\\nconsole.log(\'Successfully generated all PWA icons!\');\\n\\\"\", \"Cwd\":\"/app/applet\", \"IsDaemon\":false, \"WaitMsBeforeAsync\":5000, \"toolAction\":\"Generating PNG icons\", \"toolSummary\":\"Generate compliant PWA icons in pure Node.js\"}"
      thinking_signature: "\022\255\004\n\252\004\001i\024}\023zm\370\340\332~nQ\207=cS\321\373\272\"\332N\311\n\337\343Xy\336\362,!\210m\361\360\303\316\305\361I.+\347\3773\bGW\261L\217\206]O,\333\225\353L\357\207>&\252\270[m\026;\221\216\367z=\253\313\037\253\276\0014\224\225\024\265\301\266\277A\al\342\036\3263\320\352\306@n{G\345\341\204\030\216\213\271\305\374Y\\!|\312|\377\325\021\210\001:\302\240\323\365Z?\245%\314\370\033z\251U\2212[\017\303\275\r\263i\366:\252\312i\224\"\321$\265\326u\205eQ\330\234D\202\032u\355\256_\224\346$w\021\354\243\305K\212\307\030\234$ ROG2\316\006`\370v|\fM\304\030t\265\210\370\342\217vpr\275\362_b\204\222\331`}\206\365B_z\364 $a\225\235\354X\305T\330\r#;\372\234\272\306\207\236\023jN\272\274UL\244\243EX\324E\224\021\340\n6@\256_\'\030\324\267\n\221\024Nu\033\243\f\333Hkp\2564\244X \250Z\205/c\fb\006\016\360F\346\330I\341\0367\341p \206b R\025\222\210\250\374\303\0208\303\301J\314\317g\270Y\230>\036\313\031}\022;y\302\200\253 \350*\356?\233\312\311\367w\220\3038\321\352f\353\204m\337\034\2253\031\274mP\"\316\312\364PT\352\311V\304\311^:\314\203kj\266<\351\317j\326\220\311lx\bb\231U\364\324\212nY\357X|\335\261\227\372\357\325\352b\263K\027\367z\b\213g\n[}\033\266\\\372\003\262\361\355\256\002KtF\350bp\245\376\231f~\031\3656\346F\023\021\005\373\f9\260\265)n\031\253v\355\343\206\217\220i\264\204\277<\217\210\260\322\270\213\266\024\2465:gEG\221|j\al\355JM\260\373\223N\233\302\326Q\325-\t\220\255\314Bxx=#\a;t~^|\343\314\370\306\r2\224S3\312\2242\241#&\265?Z\357\205\213\212\2301\217P\026$\316\241\341\266f\205\205"
